ne-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 sm:px-6 h-9 sm:h-10 rounded-lg shadow-md\">Work With Victor</button></a><button class=\"lg:hidden text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></div><div class=\"fixed top-16 lg:top-20 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-accent text-accent-foreground flex items-center justify-center py-1.5 px-8\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold hover:underline flex-1 text-center\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\">View Dr. Udo's Profile &amp; Banner Summary →</a><button class=\"absolute right-3 text-accent-foreground/70 hover:text-accent-foreground text-base leading-none\" aria-label=\"Dismiss\">×</button></div><main class=\"flex-1 pt-24 lg:pt-28 transition-all duration-300\"><div><div class=\"relative bg-primary text-white py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-accent/[0.07]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h1 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">VEU AI Studio</h1><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Agentic AI Platforms Built to Support Human Decision-Making and Real-World Impact</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-primary/5 border-t border-primary/10 border-b py-4\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary\">Intelligent Platforms Built for Real Work</p></div></div><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-8 md:p-10 shadow-sm border border-border/50 relative\"><div class=\"text-6xl text-accent/20 font-heading absolute top-4 left-6\">\"</div><div class=\"relative space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pl-4\"><p>I founded VEU AI Studio to build AI platforms that solve real problems for real organizations. After 25+ years watching enterprises struggle to translate information into action — across energy, sustainability, government, and community development — I set out to create a new class of decision intelligence tools grounded in governance, sustainability, and human impact.</p><p>Every platform we build follows one principle: take organizations from information to knowledge to decisions to measurable real-world impact.</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-foreground text-sm pl-4\">— Victor Udo, PhD, FNSE | Founder, VEU AI Studio</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-secondary py-14 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 md:gap-6 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-6\"><span class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm md:text-base shadow-sm\">Information</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-accent hidden sm:block\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-6\"><span class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm md:text-base shadow-sm\">Knowledge</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-accent hidden sm:block\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-6\"><span class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm md:text-base shadow-sm\">Decisions</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-accent hidden sm:block\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-6\"><span class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground px-5 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm md:text-base shadow-sm\">Impact</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Platforms</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Four AI Platforms for Organizational and Personal Impacts</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-14\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">🔵 Launching Soon</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">SAIGE</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">SAIGE is an enterprise AI platform for ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and Sustainability governance. It introduces Enterprise Impact Performance (EIP) — a unified AI intelligence layer helping school districts, universities, governments, businesses, agencies, and NGOs understand their full enterprise impact. Features: AI-surfaced insights, unified EIP score, role-based context, scenario modelling, interactive dashboards, report generator, and justification kit.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Register Interest <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">🔵 Launching Soon</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">RelTwin</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Relationship intelligence platform using Relationship Digital Twins (RDT) to improve organizational leadership, communication, and performance.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"https://reltwin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">🔵 Launching Soon</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">ReachSMS</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">SMS-first community management platform for online communities — enabling value exchange, services delivery, and community development for large or distributed member bases.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">🔵 Launching Soon</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">PressAI</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Virtual end-to-end publishing and knowledge-sharing infrastructure — amplifying underrepresented voices through AI-powered content creation, editorial management, and distribution.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"https://ourpublishingai.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-secondary rounded-lg p-8 md:p-10 text-center mb-14\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Operating Model</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6\">VEU AI Studio works with a focused group of operating partners responsible for product execution, commercialization, and enterprise deployment. We are selectively engaging partners with experience in Platform development, enterprise sales, and domain-specific implementation.</p><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com/#contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold px-8 h-12 text-base rounded-lg shadow-md\">Partner With VEU AI Studio <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div><div class=\"mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-border\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6\">Learn More</h3><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">About Dr. Victor Udo</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Afri Decarbonization</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/publications\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Publications &amp; Research</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/advisory\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Advisory Services</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/speaking\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Speaking Engagements</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-1\">Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD</h3><p class=\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Engineer</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Executive</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">AI Builder</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Author</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Community Leader</a></p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">Founder, VEU AI Studio</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025)</a></p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Quick Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Books</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Platforms &amp; Organizations</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">VEU AI Studio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://saigedemo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">SAIGE Demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://afridecarbonization.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Afri Decarbonization Corp<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://abasipeople.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Abasi People Foundation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"VEU AI Studio | Agentic AI Platforms Built to Support Human Decision-Making Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × VEU AI Studio Agentic AI Platforms Built to Support Human Decision-Making and Real-World Impact Intelligent Platforms Built for Real Work \" I founded VEU AI Studio to build AI platforms that solve real problems for real organizations. After 25+ years watching enterprises struggle to translate information into action — across energy, sustainability, government, and community development — I set out to create a new class of decision intelligence tools grounded in governance, sustainability, and human impact. Every platform we build follows one principle: take organizations from information to knowledge to decisions to measurable real-world impact. — Victor Udo, PhD, FNSE | Founder, VEU AI Studio Information Knowledge Decisions Impact Platforms Four AI Platforms for Organizational and Personal Impacts 🔵 Launching Soon SAIGE SAIGE is an enterprise AI platform for ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and Sustainability governance. It introduces Enterprise Impact Performance (EIP) — a unified AI intelligence layer helping school districts, universities, governments, businesses, agencies, and NGOs understand their full enterprise impact. Features: AI-surfaced insights, unified EIP score, role-based context, scenario modelling, interactive dashboards, report generator, and justification kit. Learn More Register Interest 🔵 Launching Soon RelTwin Relationship intelligence platform using Relationship Digital Twins (RDT) to improve organizational leadership, communication, and performance. Learn More 🔵 Launching Soon ReachSMS SMS-first community management platform for online communities — enabling value exchange, services delivery, and community development for large or distributed member bases. Learn More 🔵 Launching Soon PressAI Virtual end-to-end publishing and knowledge-sharing infrastructure — amplifying underrepresented voices through AI-powered content creation, editorial management, and distribution. Learn More Operating Model VEU AI Studio works with a focused group of operating partners responsible for product execution, commercialization, and enterprise deployment. We are selectively engaging partners with experience in Platform development, enterprise sales, and domain-specific implementation. Partner With VEU AI Studio Learn More About Dr. Victor Udo Afri Decarbonization Publications & Research Advisory Services Speaking Engagements Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation · Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025) Quick Links Home About Blog & Insights Books Speaking News Gallery Publications Contact Platforms & Organizations VEU AI Studio SAIGE Demo Afri Decarbonization Corp Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo Connect Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com +1 302 898 9542 LinkedIn Bucknell University Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025) Lewisburg, Pennsylvania #25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23) ~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved © 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved. ↑ Back to top","contentTruncated":{"html":false,"bodyText":false,"maxStoredHtmlBytes":250000,"maxStoredBodyTextBytes":50000},"contentLength":49141,"findings":[]},{"url":"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people","depth":1,"status":"fetched","method":"browserless","httpStatus":null,"title":"Abasi People Foundation | Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, Obolo & Abasians","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/754a2285a_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n  <!-- Performance: Preconnect & DNS Prefetch -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <link href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <!-- Google Site Verification -->\n  <meta content=\"UPQLHTlymB5ijLSuhYAcOykBAhG7gB6gbBpg6n10KTA\" name=\"google-site-verification\">\n  <!-- Sitemap Discovery -->\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/sitemap\" rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\">\n  <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n  <title>Abasi People Foundation | Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, Obolo &amp; Abasians</title>\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"title\">\n  <meta content=\"Abasi People Foundation &amp; Abasi Nation — uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, Obolo (Ndito Abasi). Movement for cultural identity, self-determination, equitable development across Akwa Ibom, Cross River (Calabar, Uyo, Itu, Oron, Eket, Ibeno, Ikot Ekpene, Obot Akara), Nigeria &amp; diaspora. Founded by Dr. Victor Udo.\" name=\"description\">\n  <meta content=\"Abasi People, Abasi Nation, Ndito Abasi, Abasian, Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, Obolo, Akwa Ibom, Cross River, Calabar, Uyo, Itu, Oron, Eket, Ibeno, Ikot Ekpene, Obot Akara, ethnic identity, cultural movement, Nigeria indigenous peoples, Dr. Victor Udo\" name=\"keywords\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" name=\"author\">\n  <meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\">\n  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n  <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people\" property=\"og:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" property=\"og:title\">\n  <meta content=\"profile\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo as Abasi Nation.\" property=\"og:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" property=\"og:image\">\n  <meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\">\n  <meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo\" property=\"og:site_name\">\n  <meta content=\"en_US\" property=\"og:locale\">\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people\" name=\"twitter:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"twitter:title\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation.\" name=\"twitter:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" name=\"twitter:image\">\n  <!-- Structured Data: Person -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n      \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"jobTitle\": \"AI Platform Builder, Decarbonization Champion\",\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorudo\",\n        \"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Decarbonization\", \"AI Platforms\", \"ESG\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Electric Power Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Public Policy\", \"Abasi Nation\"],\n      \"alumniOf\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Delaware\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Pennsylvania\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"Howard University\" }\n      ],\n      \"worksFor\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\", \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation\", \"url\": \"https://afridecarbonization.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Abasi People Foundation\", \"url\": \"https://abasipeople.org\" }\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Sustainability\", \"ESG\", \"Decarbonization\", \"Energy Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Abasi Nation\", \"Public Policy\", \"Corporate Governance\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: Organization (VEU AI Studio) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n      \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" },\n      \"description\": \"Agentic AI platforms for real-world decision intelligence — SAIGE (ESG/SDGs), RelTwin, ReachSMS, and PressAI.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\"https://veuaistudio.com\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: WebSite with SearchAction (enables Google Sitelinks Search Box) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"description\": \"Official website of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI Builder, Sustainability Leader, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\n      \"potentialAction\": {\n        \"@type\": \"SearchAction\",\n        \"target\": {\n          \"@type\": \"EntryPoint\",\n          \"urlTemplate\": \"https://victorudo.com/news?q={search_term_string}\"\n        },\n        \"query-input\": \"required name=search_term_string\"\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: FAQ (common searches about Victor Udo) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Dr. Victor Udo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is an AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is SAIGE by VEU AI Studio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"SAIGE is an agentic AI platform for enterprise decision intelligence on ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and sustainability governance. It provides real-time analytics and impact assessment for organizations managing sustainability targets and carbon neutrality goals.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Abasi People Foundation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Abasi People Foundation, founded by Dr. Victor Udo, is a movement uniting seven peoples — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo — as Abasi Nation, the 4th largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria with vision for sustainable development and unity.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is Afri Decarbonization Corporation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), led by Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD as Chairman/CEO, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What topics does Dr. Victor Udo speak on?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD speaks on AI for enterprise decisions, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I book Dr. Victor Udo for a speaking engagement?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use the contact form at victorudo.com/contact and select 'Speaking Engagement' as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" } as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Dr. Udo personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are Dr. Victor Udo's published books?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is author of 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" } 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Bucknell Carbon Neutrality initiative?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD led the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" } the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: LocalBusiness (Lewisburg Office) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader. Consulting and advisory services for ESG, decarbonization, and enterprise AI decision intelligence.\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Lewisburg\",\n        \"addressRegion\": \"PA\",\n        \"postalCode\": \"17837\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-570-577-1234\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\n        \"Artificial Intelligence\",\n        \"Enterprise AI\",\n        \"Sustainability\",\n        \"ESG Governance\",\n        \"Decarbonization\",\n        \"Carbon Markets\",\n        \"Energy Transition\",\n        \"Corporate Leadership\",\n        \"Public Policy\",\n        \"African Development\"\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: ProfessionalService (Consulting & Advisory) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — Sustainability & AI Consulting\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n        \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n        \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n        \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\"\n      },\n      \"serviceType\": [\"Advisory Services\", \"Strategic Consulting\", \"ESG Governance\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Enterprise AI Decision Intelligence\"],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"description\": \"Executive advisory and strategic consulting services for organizations pursuing carbon neutrality, ESG excellence, and AI-enabled decision intelligence.\"\n    }\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-R2wm1Vio.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/index-DUFtFU2C.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\">\n   if (window.self === window.top) {\n  let lastPath = \"\";\n  function getPageNameFromPath(path) {\n    const segments = path.split(\"/\").filter(Boolean);\n    return segments[0] || null;\n  }\n  function trackPageView() {\n    const path = window.location.pathname;\n    if (path === lastPath) return;\n    lastPath = path;\n    const pageName = getPageNameFromPath(path) || \"home\";\n    con