rentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Book Victor</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Book Victor</h2></div><form class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-5\"><input required=\"\" placeholder=\"Name\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"><input required=\"\" placeholder=\"Organization\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"><input required=\"\" type=\"date\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"><select required=\"\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\"><option value=\"\">Event Type</option><option>Keynote</option><option>Panel</option><option>Workshop</option><option>Advisory</option></select><textarea required=\"\" placeholder=\"Message\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring resize-none\"></textarea><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow px-4 py-2 w-full bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold h-11 rounded-lg\" type=\"submit\">Send Inquiry</button></form></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-podcast h-8 w-8 text-primary\"><path d=\"M16.85 18.58a9 9 0 1 0-9.7 0\"></path><path d=\"M8 14a5 5 0 1 1 8 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M13 17a1 1 0 1 0-2 0l.5 4.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0Z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><span class=\"eyebrow mb-3 block\">Podcast</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Sustainability Leadership with Victor Udo</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Insights, expert conversations, and forward-looking perspectives on ESG, energy transition, AI, decarbonization, and transformational leadership.</p></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-primary p-6 md:p-8\"><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Now Playing</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1 leading-snug\">Episode 1 — Sustainability Leadership &amp; ESG in the Modern Enterprise</h3><p class=\"text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Victor explores what true sustainability leadership means in today's enterprise context — from ESG frameworks to real-world decision intelligence.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><button class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-5 w-5 text-white ml-0.5\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg></button><div class=\"flex-1 h-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full cursor-pointer relative\"><div class=\"h-full bg-accent rounded-full transition-all\" style=\"width: 0%;\"></div></div><button class=\"text-white/60 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg></button><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/60 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs mt-3 italic\">Audio available via external platform →</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-border/50 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto\"><button class=\"w-full text-left px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-secondary/50 transition-colors bg-secondary\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground\">1</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-primary\">Episode 1 — Sustainability Leadership &amp; ESG in the Modern Enterprise</p></div></button><button class=\"w-full text-left px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-secondary/50 transition-colors \"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5 bg-muted text-muted-foreground\">2</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground\">Episode 2 — Nature-Based Decarbonization: Africa's Carbon Opportunity</p></div></button><button class=\"w-full text-left px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-secondary/50 transition-colors \"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5 bg-muted text-muted-foreground\">3</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground\">Episode 3 — AI and the Future of Enterprise Impact</p></div></button><button class=\"w-full text-left px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-secondary/50 transition-colors \"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5 bg-muted text-muted-foreground\">4</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground\">Episode 4 — Carbon Neutrality in Higher Education</p></div></button><button class=\"w-full text-left px-5 py-4 flex items-start gap-4 hover:bg-secondary/50 transition-colors \"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5 bg-muted text-muted-foreground\">5</div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground\">Episode 5 — Building AI Platforms for Real-World Problems</p></div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-primary/5 border-b border-border/50 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Guest Appearance</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Smart Energy Voices — Episode #44</span></div><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 leading-snug\">Smart Energy Voices — Episode #44: Bucknell's Renewable Energy Journey</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">In this episode of Smart Energy Voices, host John Failla speaks with Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD about Bucknell University's Director of Sustainability role, the 1.76MW Bison Solar Project, and Bucknell's comprehensive strategy toward carbon neutrality by 2030.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[3:22]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Victor's journey to Bucknell and his current role</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[8:07]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">The role of renewables in Bucknell's sustainability plan</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[12:57]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">The Bison Solar Project — how it came about</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[16:25]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">What's next for Bucknell's sustainability journey</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[18:51]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">How the utility sector needs to change</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[22:27]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Why sustainability matters to Victor personally</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[26:19]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">The biggest influential person in Victor's life</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-accent font-mono font-semibold flex-shrink-0\">[34:03]</span><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">How Nigeria can move forward as a country</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6yI2SkDTTpYwkkDOtgEjXd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1DB954] hover:bg-[#1DB954]/90 text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Listen on Spotify <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.smartenergydecisions.com/podcasts/smart-energy-voices-episode-44\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border bg-card hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Full Show Notes <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-primary/5 border-b border-border/50 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Guest Appearance</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">AWA Business School — ABSChat · August 3, 2020</span></div><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 leading-snug\">ABSChat — Leadership and Sustainability with Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD joins AWA Business School's ABSChat series for a conversation on transformational leadership, the Comprehensive Sustainable Development Planning and Implementation (CSDPI) framework, and his vision for sustainable development across Africa and the USA.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.awabusiness.school/abschat-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border bg-card hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Listen on Spotify <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.awabusiness.school/abschat-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border bg-card hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Listen on iTunes <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6yI2SkDTTpYwkkDOtgEjXd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border bg-card hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Listen on Spotify (ABSChat) <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-1\">Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD</h3><p class=\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Engineer</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Executive</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">AI Builder</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Author</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Community Leader</a></p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">Founder, VEU AI Studio</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025)</a></p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Quick Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Books</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Platforms &amp; Organizations</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">VEU AI Studio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://saigedemo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">SAIGE Demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://afridecarbonization.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Afri Decarbonization Corp<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://abasipeople.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Abasi People Foundation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"Speaking & Executive Advisory | Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI, Sustainability, ESG & African Development Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × Speaking & Executive Advisory Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD brings 25 years of cross-sector leadership to keynote stages, boardrooms, and executive programs worldwide. Keynote Topics Topics Victor Speaks On AI Platforms for Sustainability How agentic AI is transforming ESG, decarbonization, and sustainable development decision-making. Decarbonization at Scale Practical pathways from carbon commitments to net-zero implementation for enterprises and governments. The Future of Electric Power Digitalization, decentralization, and decarbonization — the 3Ds reshaping global energy infrastructure. Leadership in Transition Lessons from leading across Fortune 500 corporations, government, and academia in two countries. Building AI-First Organizations How executives can architect AI-native strategies without losing the human decision-making core. Past Engagements Past Engagements March Innovation Smart Energy Summit 2022 · Bucknell University President's Sustainability Council · Ibom Power Company Board · Akwa Ibom State Government Advisory. Request to Speak Events Speaking Engagements Past and upcoming conferences, forums, and speaking opportunities where Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD brings his expertise in AI, sustainability, ESG leadership, and transformational change. Upcoming Events Past Events Featured AASHE Annual Conference 2026 Enterprise Impact Performance: Decision Intelligence for Carbon Neutrality at Scale October 15, 2026 Denver, Colorado Association for the Advancement of Sustainability in Higher Education Keynote presentation on how higher education institutions can move from sustainability reporting to real-time decision intelligence using AI-powered governance frameworks. Smart Energy Decisions — Net Zero Forum 2026 Decarbonization & Digital Transformation in the Energy Sector September 22, 2026 New York, NY Smart Energy Decisions Panel discussion on the role of digitalization, decentralization, and nature-based solutions in achieving net-zero energy systems. Broadcast Archive The 'DO' Show — Episode Archive ThePOLwithVictorUdo was broadcast on 2 television stations (AKBC TV Channel 45/StarTimes 113 and NTA Uyo) and 5 radio stations (AKBC Radio 90.5 FM, Comfort FM 95.1 FM, Planet FM 101.1 FM, Atlantic FM 104.5 FM, Inspiration FM 105.9 FM) across Abia, Akwa Ibom, Cross River, and Rivers States — reaching over 10 million people for more than three years. Agriculture 1. Agrobusiness — Encouraging Young Leaders to Engage in Agriculture Watch Episode Industry & Skills 2. Challenges & Impediments to Industrialization Among LGAs and States Watch Episode Governance 3. Natural Resources in Akwa Ibom State — Converting & Improving the Economy Watch Episode Youth & Entrepreneurship 4. Billion Dollar Ideas — Job Opportunities Using New Media Watch Episode Agriculture 5. Wealth Creation Using Agriculture — Honey as a Raw Material Watch Episode Industry & Skills 6. Wealth Creation with AKITSA — Fashion Designing Watch Episode Youth & Entrepreneurship 7. Capacity Building in the Broadcasting Business Watch Episode Governance 8. Individual Contributions Geared Towards Employment in Akwa Ibom Watch Episode Youth & Entrepreneurship 9. Converting Opportunities in Sports, Environment, Tourism & Agriculture into Businesses Watch Episode Finance & Wealth 10. Digital Currency & Cryptocurrency Watch Episode Leadership 11. 3 Types of Leaders — The Front, Centre, and Back Watch Episode Youth & Entrepreneurship 12. Encouraging Young Entrepreneurs and CEOs Watch Episode Youth & Entrepreneurship 13. Interactive Discussions on Starting and Growing Businesses to Success Watch Episode Leadership 14. Nurturing and Developing the Right Business Sense Watch Episode Leadership 15. Life in the Past, Today and the Future — Christmas Edition Watch Episode Full episode archive available on YouTube and Facebook — follow ThePOLwithVictorUdo for access. Follow on Facebook Listen Podcast Book Victor Book Victor Event Type Keynote Panel Workshop Advisory Send Inquiry Podcast Sustainability Leadership with Victor Udo Insights, expert conversations, and forward-looking perspectives on ESG, energy transition, AI, decarbonization, and transformational leadership. Now Playing Episode 1 — Sustainability Leadership & ESG in the Modern Enterprise Victor explores what true sustainability leadership means in today's enterprise context — from ESG frameworks to real-world decision intelligence. Audio available via external platform → 1 Episode 1 — Sustainability Leadership & ESG in the Modern Enterprise 2 Episode 2 — Nature-Based Decarbonization: Africa's Carbon Opportunity 3 Episode 3 — AI and the Future of Enterprise Impact 4 Episode 4 — Carbon Neutrality in Higher Education 5 Episode 5 — Building AI Platforms for Real-World Problems Guest Appearance Smart Energy Voices — Episode #44 Smart Energy Voices — Episode #44: Bucknell's Renewable Energy Journey In this episode of Smart Energy Voices, host John Failla speaks with Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD about Bucknell University's Director of Sustainability role, the 1.76MW Bison Solar Project, and Bucknell's comprehensive strategy toward carbon neutrality by 2030. [3:22] Victor's journey to Bucknell and his current role [8:07] The role of renewables in Bucknell's sustainability plan [12:57] The Bison Solar Project — how it came about [16:25] What's next for Bucknell's sustainability journey [18:51] How the utility sector needs to change [22:27] Why sustainability matters to Victor personally [26:19] The biggest influential person in Victor's life [34:03] How Nigeria can move forward as a country Listen on Spotify Full Show Notes Guest Appearance AWA Business School — ABSChat · August 3, 2020 ABSChat — Leadership and Sustainability with Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD joins AWA Business School's ABSChat series for a conversation on transformational leadership, the Comprehensive Sustainable Development Planning and Implementation (CSDPI) framework, and his vision for sustainable development across Africa and the USA. Listen on Spotify Listen on iTunes Listen on Spotify (ABSChat) Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation · Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025) Quick Links Home About Blog & Insights Books Speaking News Gallery Publications Contact Platforms & Organizations VEU AI Studio SAIGE Demo Afri Decarbonization Corp Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo Connect Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com +1 302 898 9542 LinkedIn Bucknell University Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025) Lewisburg, Pennsylvania #25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23) ~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved © 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved. ↑ Back to top","contentTruncated":{"html":false,"bodyText":false,"maxStoredHtmlBytes":250000,"maxStoredBodyTextBytes":50000},"contentLength":75195,"findings":[]},{"url":"https://victorudo.com/publications","depth":1,"status":"fetched","method":"browserless","httpStatus":null,"title":"Publications | Dr. Victor Udo | Sustainability, AI, Energy & Governance Research","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/754a2285a_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n  <!-- Performance: Preconnect & DNS Prefetch -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <link href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <!-- Google Site Verification -->\n  <meta content=\"UPQLHTlymB5ijLSuhYAcOykBAhG7gB6gbBpg6n10KTA\" name=\"google-site-verification\">\n  <!-- Sitemap Discovery -->\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/sitemap\" rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\">\n  <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n  <title>Publications | Dr. Victor Udo | Sustainability, AI, Energy &amp; Governance Research</title>\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"title\">\n  \n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, VEU AI Studio, SAIGE, sustainability, ESG, decarbonization, AI, Abasi Nation, Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, Obolo, Ndito Abasi, Abasians, Abasi People Foundation, Afri Decarbonization, carbon neutrality, Nigeria, Akwa Ibom, Bucknell University\" name=\"keywords\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" name=\"author\">\n  <meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\">\n  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n  <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/publications\" property=\"og:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" property=\"og:title\">\n  <meta content=\"profile\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo as Abasi Nation.\" property=\"og:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" property=\"og:image\">\n  <meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\">\n  <meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo\" property=\"og:site_name\">\n  <meta content=\"en_US\" property=\"og:locale\">\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/publications\" name=\"twitter:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"twitter:title\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation.\" name=\"twitter:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" name=\"twitter:image\">\n  <!-- Structured Data: Person -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n      \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"jobTitle\": \"AI Platform Builder, Decarbonization Champion\",\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorudo\",\n        \"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Decarbonization\", \"AI Platforms\", \"ESG\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Electric Power Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Public Policy\", \"Abasi Nation\"],\n      \"alumniOf\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Delaware\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Pennsylvania\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"Howard University\" }\n      ],\n      \"worksFor\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\", \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation\", \"url\": \"https://afridecarbonization.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Abasi People Foundation\", \"url\": \"https://abasipeople.org\" }\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Sustainability\", \"ESG\", \"Decarbonization\", \"Energy Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Abasi Nation\", \"Public Policy\", \"Corporate Governance\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: Organization (VEU AI Studio) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n      \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" },\n      \"description\": \"Agentic AI platforms for real-world decision intelligence — SAIGE (ESG/SDGs), RelTwin, ReachSMS, and PressAI.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\"https://veuaistudio.com\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: WebSite with SearchAction (enables Google Sitelinks Search Box) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"description\": \"Official website of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI Builder, Sustainability Leader, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\n      \"potentialAction\": {\n        \"@type\": \"SearchAction\",\n        \"target\": {\n          \"@type\": \"EntryPoint\",\n          \"urlTemplate\": \"https://victorudo.com/news?q={search_term_string}\"\n        },\n        \"query-input\": \"required name=search_term_string\"\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: FAQ (common searches about Victor Udo) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Dr. Victor Udo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is an AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is SAIGE by VEU AI Studio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"SAIGE is an agentic AI platform for enterprise decision intelligence on ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and sustainability governance. It provides real-time analytics and impact assessment for organizations managing sustainability targets and carbon neutrality goals.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Abasi People Foundation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Abasi People Foundation, founded by Dr. Victor Udo, is a movement uniting seven peoples — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo — as Abasi Nation, the 4th largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria with vision for sustainable development and unity.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is Afri Decarbonization Corporation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), led by Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD as Chairman/CEO, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What topics does Dr. Victor Udo speak on?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD speaks on AI for enterprise decisions, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I book Dr. Victor Udo for a speaking engagement?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use the contact form at victorudo.com/contact and select 'Speaking Engagement' as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" } as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Dr. Udo personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are Dr. Victor Udo's published books?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is author of 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" } 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Bucknell Carbon Neutrality initiative?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD led the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" } the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: LocalBusiness (Lewisburg Office) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader. Consulting and advisory services for ESG, decarbonization, and enterprise AI decision intelligence.\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Lewisburg\",\n        \"addressRegion\": \"PA\",\n        \"postalCode\": \"17837\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-570-577-1234\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\n        \"Artificial Intelligence\",\n        \"Enterprise AI\",\n        \"Sustainability\",\n        \"ESG Governance\",\n        \"Decarbonization\",\n        \"Carbon Markets\",\n        \"Energy Transition\",\n        \"Corporate Leadership\",\n        \"Public Policy\",\n        \"African Development\"\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: ProfessionalService (Consulting & Advisory) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — Sustainability & AI Consulting\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n        \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n        \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n        \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\"\n      },\n      \"serviceType\": [\"Advisory Services\", \"Strategic Consulting\", \"ESG Governance\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Enterprise AI Decision Intelligence\"],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"description\": \"Executive advisory and strategic consulting services for organizations pursuing carbon neutrality, ESG excellence, and AI-enabled decision intelligence.\"\n    }\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-R2wm1Vio.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/index-DUFtFU2C.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\">\n   if (window.self === window.top) {\n  let lastPath = \"\";\n  function getPageNameFromPath(path) {\n    const segments = path.split(\"/\").filter(Boolean);\n    return segments[0] || null;\n  }\n  function trackPageView() {\n    const path = window.location.pathname;\n    if (path === lastPath) return;\n    lastPath = path;\n    const pageName = getPageNameFromPath(path) || \"home\";\n    const appId = \"69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf\";\n    if (!appId) return;\n    fetch(`/api/app-logs/${appId}/log-user-in-app/${pageName}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n    }).catch(() => {});\n  }\n  const originalPushState = history.pushState.bind(history);\n  history.pushState = function (...args) {\n    originalPushState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  const originalReplaceState = history.replaceState.bind(history);\n  history.replaceState = function (...args) {\n    originalReplaceState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener(\"popstate\", trackPageView);\n  trackPageView();\n}\n  </script>\n  <meta content=\"yes\" name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\">\n  <meta content=\"black\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\">\n  <meta content=\"VictorUdo.Com\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\">\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/publications\" rel=\"canonical\">\n  <script data-seo-source=\"builder\" type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"publications\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/publications\"}]}\n  </script>\n <meta content=\"Peer-reviewed publications and books by Dr. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD with 687+ citations on ResearchGate. Topics include engineering, public policy, sustainable development, electric power systems, and technology governance for Nigeria and Africa.\" name=\"description\"></head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"transition-all duration-500 bg-primary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between h-16 lg:h-20\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"text-white\"><div class=\"font-heading text-lg lg:text-xl font-bold leading-tight\">Dr. Victor Udo</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] tracking-wide hidden sm:block whitespace-nowrap\">Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader</div></div></a><div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/\">Home</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/about\">About</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">VEU AI Studio</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People</a><div class=\"absolute left-0 mt-0 w-52 bg-primary border border-white/20 rounded-lg shadow-lg opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-200 z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People Foundation</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></div></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white bg-white/15\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><a title=\"Carbon Footprint Calculator\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/carbon-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></a><a title=\"Dr. Udo's Banner &amp; Profile Summary\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-user-round h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 21a6 6 0 0 0-12 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"4\"></circle><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></a><div class=\"relative hidden xl:block\"><button title=\"Search books, news...\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative group\"><button class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\">More ▾</button><div class=\"absolute right-0 mt-0 w-52 bg-primary border border-white/20 rounded-lg shadow-lg opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-200 z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/carbon-calculator\">Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Afri Decarbonization</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/advisory\">Advisory Services</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/news\">News</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/mothers-memorial\">Mother's Memorial</a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 sm:px-6 h-9 sm:h-10 rounded-lg shadow-md\">Work With Victor</button></a><button class=\"lg:hidden text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></div><div class=\"fixed top-16 lg:top-20 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-accent text-accent-foreground flex items-center justify-center py-1.5 px-8\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold hover:underline flex-1 text-center\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\">View Dr. Udo's Profile &amp; Banner Summary →</a><button class=\"absolute right-3 text-accent-foreground/70 hover:text-accent-foreground text-base leading-none\" aria-label=\"Dismiss\">×</button></div><main class=\"flex-1 pt-24 lg:pt-28 transition-all duration-300\"><div><div class=\"relative bg-primary text-white py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-accent/[0.07]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h1 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">Publications</h1><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Peer-reviewed publications spanning engineering, public policy, sustainable development, electric power systems and technology.</p></div></div><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: none;\">Library</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.38763px);\">Search Publications</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-8\"><div class=\"relative flex-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search by title...\" class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-background text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-primary text-primary-foreground border-primary\">All</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Book</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Journal</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Dissertation</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">Dissertation</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Exploring Patterns of Sustainable Development, Governance and E-Infrastructure Capacities of Nations for Global Equity Praxis</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">PhD Dissertation — University of Delaware, 2003</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Ranked 132 countries on governance, environmental, social, and technological sustainability across 60+ variables. Principal Advisor: Prof. Robert Warren, School of Urban Affairs and Public Policy.</p><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/71ee5fb87_VEUDissertation.docx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">Dissertation</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Adaptive Hierarchical Control for Large-Scale Interconnected Systems</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Master's Thesis (ME) — Howard University</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Thesis exploring adaptive hierarchical control strategies for large-scale interconnected power systems, contributing to foundational research in load-frequency control methodologies.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership &amp; Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Fulton Books, 2020</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Navigates post-colonial political and diplomatic conditions, class structure, economic organization, Nigerian culture, ethnic diversity, and the environment. A comprehensive prescription for forward progress through operational citizenship and smartphone democracy. Prescribed reading for Nigerian students, policymakers, and civil servants.</p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Which-Way-Nigeria-Sustainable-Development/dp/1646540387\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation: Looking at Nigeria</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">2021</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Presents the electric power sector as an AC/DC infrastructural value chain using Nigeria as a metaphor. Organized around the Four Concentric Hexagons framework.</p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Sustainability-Insights-Electric-Sector-Transformation-ebook/dp/B096YN3LM8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development: Looking at Nigeria</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">2021</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Applies the CSDPI/EGSD framework to Nigerian subnational development challenges.</p><a href=\"https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/which-way-nigeria-victor-udo-fnse-phd/1136531763\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Problems of Sustainable Development, Vol. 4, No. 2, pp. 23–44, 2009</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Bridging the Gaps for Global Sustainable Development: A Quantitative Analysis</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Journal of Environmental Management, June 2009</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">University of Delaware — Center for Research in Wind (CREW) / Pepco Holdings / PJM Interconnection, 2008</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">First real-time demonstration of grid-integrated vehicle providing frequency regulation on the PJM grid. Co-authored with Willett Kempton, Ken Huber, Kevin Komara, Steven Letendre, Scott Baker, Doug Brunner, and Nathaniel Pearre.</p><a href=\"https://crew.udel.edu/v2g/publications/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Integrating Large Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEEE Conference on Global Sustainable Energy Infrastructure (IEEE Energy 2030), November 2008</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">The Modern Electric Power Industry and Global Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">International Journal of Modern Engineering, Vol. 6, No. 1, Fall 2005</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics, Washington DC, October 2003</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">An Adaptive Control Scheme for Load-Frequency Control of Multi-area Power Systems Parts I &amp; II</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Electric Power Systems Research Journal, 1992</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Self-tuning Load Frequency Control: Multilevel Adaptive Approach</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEE Proceedings on Generation, Transmission and Distribution, Vol. 141</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"bg-secondary rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10 border border-border/50\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Resource Library</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Research Download Center</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Access papers, books, datasets, and supporting materials from Dr. Udo's research portfolio.</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Papers</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/255621263_A_Test_of_Vehicle-to-Grid_V2G_for_Energy_Storage_and_Frequency_Regulation_in_the_PJM_System\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">V2G Grid Demonstration (2008)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.1 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0301479709001388\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Bridging Gaps for Global Sustainable Development (2009)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">1.8 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/279163999_Recent_results_on_the_integration_of_variable_renewable_electric_power_into_the_US_grid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Integration of Variable Renewable Electric Power</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">1.5 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Books</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Which-Way-Nigeria-Sustainable-Development/dp/1646540387\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Which Way Nigeria? — Structure, Leadership &amp; Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">3.2 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Sustainability-Insights-Electric-Sector-Transformation-ebook/dp/B096YN3LM8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.8 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/which-way-nigeria-victor-udo-fnse-phd/1136531763\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.6 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-5 w-5\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Data &amp; Datasets</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/71ee5fb87_VEUDissertation.docx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Dissertation: 132-Nation Sustainability Index &amp; Framework</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">445 KB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/9cc991fb1_FindalDpre.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Dissertation Defense Presentation</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">567 KB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">ResearchGate Profile (687+ Citations)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">Profile</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Career Arc</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Interactive Research Roadmap</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Click any milestone to explore detailed research, technical achievements, and associated publications.</p></div><div class=\"relative max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-border\"></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">1992–2003</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Grid Engineering &amp; Load Control</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Published seminal papers on self-tuning load frequency control. Transitioned from Atlantic Electric to Pepco Holdings executive roles.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">IEE/IEEE Publications</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">NJ Renewable Task Force</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">PhD — University of Delaware</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2003–2010</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Research Partnerships &amp; V2G</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Co-authored landmark papers with Prof. Jansson (Rowan) and Prof. Pawłowski (Poland). Led world's first V2G grid demonstration.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">V2G Publication (415+ citations)</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">6 Peer-Reviewed Papers</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">IEEE Energy 2030 Conference</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2010–2020</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Academic Leadership &amp; Sustainability</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Served as Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University. Authored 3 books on Nigeria's governance and energy transformation.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">Bucknell Carbon Neutrality Strategy</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">3 Published Books</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">Susquehanna River Research</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2020–Present</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Decarbonization &amp; Platform Building</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Founded VEU AI Studio (4 AI platforms) and Afri Decarbonization Corporation. Consultant on NJ State Energy Security Plan.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">VEU AI Studio Launch</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">ADC Foundation</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">NJSESP Consultant (BPU)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Research Ecosystem</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Collaborative Partner Profiles</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Explore the leading researchers, institutions, and thought partners who shaped Dr. Udo's academic trajectory.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://i1.rgstatic.net/ii/profile.image/617669665497089-1524275332363_Q64/Peter-Jansson-4.jpg\" alt=\"Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD\" class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-border mb-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm leading-tight mb-1\">Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mb-2\">Associate Professor of Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-3 italic\">Rowan University (formerly) → Bucknell University</p>