blications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>Faith-Based Community Engagement and Sustainable Development (collaborative work)</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/8851dae41_image.png\" alt=\"Prof. Ahmed Rubaai, PhD\" class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-border mb-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm leading-tight mb-1\">Prof. Ahmed Rubaai, PhD</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mb-2\">Professor of Electrical Engineering</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-3 italic\">Howard University</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Washington, DC, USA</div><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Ahmed-Rubaai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline\">ResearchGate <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\