=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Co-authored Papers</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-accent\">2019</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Collaboration Started</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-violet-600\">7+</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Years Active</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Key Publications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>Collaborative leadership on Bucknell University's sustainability and carbon neutrality roadmap (2019–2025)</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/5b027dbc5_image.png\" alt=\"Prof. Willett Kempton, PhD\" class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-border mb-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm leading-tight mb-1\">Prof. Willett Kempton, PhD</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mb-2\">Director, Center for Carbon-Free Transportation</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-3 italic\">University of Delaware</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Newark, Delaware, USA</div><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Willett-Kempton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline\">ResearchGate <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 p-4 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-lg\"><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed font-medium italic\">Co-led the world's first V2G grid demonstration — landmark publication with 415+ citations globally.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Research Focus</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G), electric vehicles, grid integration, transportation electrification</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border/40\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary\">1</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Co-authored Papers</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-accent\">2008</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Collaboration Started</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-violet-600\">18+</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Years Active</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Key Publications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System (2008)</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/6e6fbd765_21KarenMcGrath001.jpg\" alt=\"Karen McGrath\" class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-border mb-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm leading-tight mb-1\">Karen McGrath</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mb-2\">Working Group on Environmental Social and Governance (ESG) Education</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-3 italic\">Bucknell University</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted-foreground text-xs mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Lewisburg, Pennsylvania, USA</div></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 p-4 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-lg\"><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed font-medium italic\">Key partner in advancing ESG education and sustainability curriculum development at Bucknell University.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Research Focus</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">ESG education, sustainability curriculum, corporate responsibility, governance frameworks</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border/40\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary\">0</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Co-authored Papers</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-accent\">2019</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Collaboration Started</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-violet-600\">7+</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Years Active</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Key Publications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>Collaborative leadership on ESG education initiatives as member of Bucknell's President's Sustainability Council</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-secondary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Research Collaborations</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Academic Research Partnerships</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto text-muted-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Peer-reviewed publications co-authored with Prof. Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University / Bucknell University), Prof. Artur Pawłowski, and other leading researchers — spanning sustainable development, grid integration, and global equity.</p></div><div class=\"mb-12 bg-primary rounded-2xl p-8 text-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-white/5\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-accent/10\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-accent/20 border border-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-7 w-7 text-accent\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div><span class=\"eyebrow text-white/60 mb-2 block\">Gubernatorial Appointment · State of New Jersey</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 leading-tight\">Member, New Jersey Renewable Energy Task Force</h3><p class=\"text-white/75 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Appointed by the <strong class=\"text-white\">Governor of New Jersey</strong> to the State's Renewable Energy Task Force — a distinction earned in recognition of Victor's expertise in electric power systems, grid infrastructure, and renewable energy integration during his tenure at Pepco Holdings (Conectiv / Atlantic Electric). This appointment placed him at the policy forefront of New Jersey's early clean energy transition, informing state-level decisions on renewable portfolio standards, utility restructuring, and grid modernization. His work on the Task Force directly preceded and shaped the academic research collaborations with Prof. Peter Mark Jansson at Rowan University, producing influential papers on PV grid integration and sustainable development.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star h-7 w-7 text-primary\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><div><span class=\"eyebrow mb-2 block\">PhD Dissertation Committee · University of Delaware</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 leading-tight\">Member, PhD Dissertation Committee — Offshore Wind Power Research</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-4\">Appointed as a member of the PhD dissertation committee at the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">University of Delaware's College of Earth, Ocean, and Environment</strong> — overseeing a doctoral dissertation comprising four essays on offshore wind power: <em>Potential, Development, Regulatory Framework, and Grid Integration</em>. Victor's role brought the critical perspective of a senior utility executive (Pepco Holdings / Conectiv) who was simultaneously conducting live V2G experiments on the PJM grid, making him uniquely qualified to bridge academic research and real-world power system practice.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Offshore Wind Potential</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Wind Farm Development</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Regulatory Framework</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Grid Integration</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-7 w-7 text-accent\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div><span class=\"eyebrow mb-2 block\">BPU Contract · Rowan University · 2023–2025</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 leading-tight\">Consultant, New Jersey State Energy Security Plan (NJSESP)</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-4\">Appointed as a consultant on the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">New Jersey State Energy Security Plan (NJSESP)</strong> — a contract awarded to the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">Rowan University Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering</strong> by the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">New Jersey Board of Public Utilities (BPU)</strong>. Victor served alongside Prof. Peter Mark Jansson and the Rowan engineering team, bringing decades of utility operations expertise — gained at Pepco Holdings, Conectiv, and Atlantic Electric — to inform New Jersey's statewide energy security strategy. The engagement represented a direct application of his career-long work at the intersection of electric power systems, grid reliability, and public policy.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Energy Security</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Grid Reliability</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">BPU Policy</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Utility Operations</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border\">Public Policy</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-5 flex gap-4 items-start shadow-sm\"><img src=\"https://i1.rgstatic.net/ii/profile.image/617669665497089-1524275332363_Q64/Peter-Jansson-4.jpg\" alt=\"Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0 border-2 border-secondary\"><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mt-0.5\">Associate Professor of Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-0.5\">Rowan University (at time of collaboration) → Bucknell University</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-1 italic\">Power systems, renewable energy, photovoltaic integration, grid engineering</p><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Peter-Jansson-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline\">ResearchGate Profile <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-5 flex gap-4 items-start shadow-sm\"><img src=\"https://i1.rgstatic.net/ii/profile.image/903031616991235-1592310923822_Q64/Artur-Pawlowski.jpg\" alt=\"Prof. Artur Pawłowski, PhD\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0 border-2 border-secondary\"><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Prof. Artur Pawłowski, PhD</h4><p class=\"text-accent text-xs font-medium mt-0.5\">Professor of Environmental Engineering</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-0.5\">Lublin University of Technology, Poland</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs mt-1 italic\">Sustainable development philosophy, ecological economics, S-Curve models</p><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Artur-Pawlowski\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline\">ResearchGate Profile <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-secondary rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10 border border-border/50\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-5 text-center\">Research Impact at a Glance</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-accent mb-1\">687+</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">Total Research Citations</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">Across ResearchGate &amp; Semantic Scholar</div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-1\">415+</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">V2G Paper Citations</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">World's first grid demonstration</div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-1\">14</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">Peer-Reviewed Publications</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">Journals, IEEE conferences &amp; books</div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1\">4</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">Countries in Collaboration</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">USA · Poland · Nigeria · UK</div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-violet-600 mb-1\">33</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">Years of Academic Engagement</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">1992 IEE/IEEE publications to present</div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-border/40 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-1\">3</div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground leading-tight mb-1\">Lead Research Partners</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight\">Jansson · Pawłowski · Kempton</div></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">IEEE Conference Paper</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (IEEE SMC) · Washington D.C., October 2003</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University) · Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings / Conectiv)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Co-authored during Victor's tenure as a member of the New Jersey Governor's Renewable Energy Task Force. The paper examined the structural role of the electric power industry as a driver of — or barrier to — global sustainable development, laying a conceptual framework later expanded in subsequent journal publications. Presented at IEEE's flagship Systems, Man, and Cybernetics conference in Washington D.C.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/ICSMC.2003.1244662\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-border bg-background hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\">DOI <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">IEEE Conference Paper</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">Integrating Large-Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">IEEE Energy 2030 Conference (IEEE ENERGY 2008) · November 2008</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan) · Richard Michelfelder (Rutgers) · Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings) · Gary Sheehan · Michael Freeman + colleagues</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Examined how the U.S. electric power industry could reliably integrate large-scale dispersed renewable generators (wind and PV) as Renewable Portfolio Standards (RPS) were adopted across 26+ states. Documented the first PJM-connected utility-scale PV plant in Pennsylvania and analyzed how aggressive public policy and market forces shaped PV grid integration.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/224384092_Integrating_Large-Scale_Photovoltaic_Power_Plants_into_the_Grid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> ResearchGate</a><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/ENERGY.2008.4781007\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-border bg-background hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\">DOI <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Peer-Reviewed Journal</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">Bridging the Gaps for Global Sustainable Development: A Quantitative Analysis</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">Journal of Environmental Management · Elsevier, Vol. 90, Issue 12, September 2009, pp. 3700–3707</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings) · Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">A quantitative global study ranking 132 nations' sustainable development capacity across social, technological, and environmental dimensions. The study introduced an aggregate SD parameter and found a global hierarchy of needs among nations analogous to Maslow's individual hierarchy — demonstrating that nations struggling to survive prioritize social sustainability over environmental sustainability.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/26270939_Bridging_the_gaps_for_global_sustainable_development_A_quantitative_analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> ResearchGate</a><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/J.JENVMAN.2008.12.020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-border bg-background hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\">DOI <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19500899/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-border bg-background hover:bg-secondary text-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\">PubMed <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Peer-Reviewed Journal</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">Problems of Sustainable Development · Vol. 4, No. 2, pp. 23–44, 2009</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Victor E. Udo · Artur Pawłowski (Lublin University of Technology, Poland)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Proposed a new paradigm for understanding global human progress in the context of planetary sustainability. Applied the Cascaded–S Curve Model to explore how humanity's trajectory across society, technology, and the environment requires a systems-level rethink of global governance and development strategy.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/228284584_Human_Progress_Towards_Equitable_Sustainable_Development_A_Philosophical_Exploration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> ResearchGate</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Peer-Reviewed Journal</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development – Part II: Empirical Exploration</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">Problems of Sustainable Development · 2011</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Victor E. Udo · Artur Pawłowski (Lublin University of Technology, Poland)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Empirical companion to Part I — proposes a formal, operational definition of sustainable development and applies it to compare 132 national polities. Explores patterns and gaps in SD index performance, identifying how different governance and infrastructure contexts shape development trajectories.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/228320362_Human_Progress_Towards_Equitable_Sustainable_Development_-_Part_II_Empirical_Exploration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> ResearchGate</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">Conference Paper</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-1 leading-snug\">The Challenges to Dam Removal on the Susquehanna River: A Focus on Conowingo and PJM</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mb-1\">14th Susquehanna River Symposium · Bucknell University, Lewisburg, Pennsylvania · October 18–19, 2019</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Peter Mark Jansson (Bucknell University) · Victor E. Udo (Bucknell University)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5\">Investigated the energy, environmental, and grid reliability implications of removing the Conowingo Dam on the Susquehanna River — a critical PJM interconnection asset. Explored the balance between ecological restoration, hydroelectric power generation, and grid stability in the context of sustainable energy policy and river system management.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"eyebrow text-white/60 mb-3 block text-center\">Landmark Research · 415+ Citations</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-8\">Pioneering <span class=\"text-accent\">Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G)</span> Research</h2><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"bg-accent/20 text-accent text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">415+ Citations</span><span class=\"bg-green-900/40 text-green-300 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">World's First V2G Grid Demo</span><span class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">2008 (revised January 2009)</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 leading-snug\">A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System</h3><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs mb-1 italic\">Willett Kempton, Victor Udo, Ken Huber, Kevin Komara, Steve Letendre, Scott Baker, Doug Brunner &amp; Nat Pearre</p><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs mb-5 italic\">University of Delaware / Pepco Holdings, Inc. / PJM Interconnect</p><p class=\"text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">The world's first practical demonstration of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) power — providing real-time frequency regulation from an electric car to the PJM grid system. Victor Udo contributed as the Pepco Holdings representative, making this the first industry-utility proof of V2G at grid scale. The paper became a foundational reference for global EV-to-grid policy and clean energy transition strategy.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/255621263_A_Test_of_Vehicle-to-Grid_V2G_for_Energy_Storage_and_Frequency_Regulation_in_the_PJM_System\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Read on ResearchGate →</a><a href=\"http://www.udel.edu/V2G/resources/test-v2g-in-pjm-jan09.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/20 text-white hover:bg-white/10 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">Download PDF</a><a href=\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/A-Test-of-Vehicle-to-Grid-(V2G)-for-Energy-Storage-Kempton-Udo/9987ffdb1f985e43705749ec48903f67f1b58c69\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/20 text-white hover:bg-white/10 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors\">415 Citations →</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Doctoral Research</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Dissertation</h2></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-8 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Exploring Patterns of Sustainable Development, Governance and E-Infrastructure Capacities of Nations for Global Equity Praxis</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">University of Delaware, 2003</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Principal Advisor: Prof. Robert Warren, School of Urban Affairs and Public Policy</p><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block bg-secondary rounded-lg p-4 text-center hover:bg-secondary/80 transition-colors\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">687+ research citations on ResearchGate</p><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-2\">View all publications →</p></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-border\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6\">Explore Related Content</h3><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">About Dr. Victor Udo</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/books\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Books &amp; Authored Works</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Research on ResearchGate</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/speaking\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">Speaking &amp; Thought Leadership</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">VEU AI Studio</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-border hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all\" href=\"/news\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors flex-1\">News &amp; Media Coverage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-primary transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-1\">Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD</h3><p class=\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Engineer</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Executive</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">AI Builder</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Author</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Community Leader</a></p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">Founder, VEU AI Studio</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025)</a></p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Quick Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Books</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Platforms &amp; Organizations</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">VEU AI Studio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://saigedemo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">SAIGE Demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://afridecarbonization.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Afri Decarbonization Corp<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://abasipeople.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Abasi People Foundation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"Publications | Dr. Victor Udo | Sustainability, AI, Energy & Governance Research Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × Publications Peer-reviewed publications spanning engineering, public policy, sustainable development, electric power systems and technology. Library Search Publications All Book Journal Dissertation Dissertation Exploring Patterns of Sustainable Development, Governance and E-Infrastructure Capacities of Nations for Global Equity Praxis PhD Dissertation — University of Delaware, 2003 Ranked 132 countries on governance, environmental, social, and technological sustainability across 60+ variables. Principal Advisor: Prof. Robert Warren, School of Urban Affairs and Public Policy. View → Dissertation Adaptive Hierarchical Control for Large-Scale Interconnected Systems Master's Thesis (ME) — Howard University Thesis exploring adaptive hierarchical control strategies for large-scale interconnected power systems, contributing to foundational research in load-frequency control methodologies. Book Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development Fulton Books, 2020 Navigates post-colonial political and diplomatic conditions, class structure, economic organization, Nigerian culture, ethnic diversity, and the environment. A comprehensive prescription for forward progress through operational citizenship and smartphone democracy. Prescribed reading for Nigerian students, policymakers, and civil servants. View → Book Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation: Looking at Nigeria 2021 Presents the electric power sector as an AC/DC infrastructural value chain using Nigeria as a metaphor. Organized around the Four Concentric Hexagons framework. View → Book Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development: Looking at Nigeria 2021 Applies the CSDPI/EGSD framework to Nigerian subnational development challenges. View → Journal Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration Problems of Sustainable Development, Vol. 4, No. 2, pp. 23–44, 2009 Journal Bridging the Gaps for Global Sustainable Development: A Quantitative Analysis Journal of Environmental Management, June 2009 Journal A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System University of Delaware — Center for Research in Wind (CREW) / Pepco Holdings / PJM Interconnection, 2008 First real-time demonstration of grid-integrated vehicle providing frequency regulation on the PJM grid. Co-authored with Willett Kempton, Ken Huber, Kevin Komara, Steven Letendre, Scott Baker, Doug Brunner, and Nathaniel Pearre. View → Journal Integrating Large Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid IEEE Conference on Global Sustainable Energy Infrastructure (IEEE Energy 2030), November 2008 Journal The Modern Electric Power Industry and Global Sustainable Development International Journal of Modern Engineering, Vol. 6, No. 1, Fall 2005 Journal The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics, Washington DC, October 2003 Journal An Adaptive Control Scheme for Load-Frequency Control of Multi-area Power Systems Parts I & II Electric Power Systems Research Journal, 1992 Journal Self-tuning Load Frequency Control: Multilevel Adaptive Approach IEE Proceedings on Generation, Transmission and Distribution, Vol. 141 Resource Library Research Download Center Access papers, books, datasets, and supporting materials from Dr. Udo's research portfolio. Papers V2G Grid Demonstration (2008) 2.1 MB Bridging Gaps for Global Sustainable Development (2009) 1.8 MB Integration of Variable Renewable Electric Power 1.5 MB Books Which Way Nigeria? — Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development 3.2 MB Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation 2.8 MB Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development 2.6 MB Data & Datasets Dissertation: 132-Nation Sustainability Index & Framework 445 KB Dissertation Defense Presentation 567 KB ResearchGate Profile (687+ Citations) Profile Career Arc Interactive Research Roadmap Click any milestone to explore detailed research, technical achievements, and associated publications. 1992–2003 Grid Engineering & Load Control Published seminal papers on self-tuning load frequency control. Transitioned from Atlantic Electric to Pepco Holdings executive roles. IEE/IEEE Publications NJ Renewable Task Force PhD — University of Delaware Click to see technical details & papers → 2003–2010 Research Partnerships & V2G Co-authored landmark papers with Prof. Jansson (Rowan) and Prof. Pawłowski (Poland). Led world's first V2G grid demonstration. V2G Publication (415+ citations) 6 Peer-Reviewed Papers IEEE Energy 2030 Conference Click to see technical details & papers → 2010–2020 Academic Leadership & Sustainability Served as Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University. Authored 3 books on Nigeria's governance and energy transformation. Bucknell Carbon Neutrality Strategy 3 Published Books Susquehanna River Research Click to see technical details & papers → 2020–Present Decarbonization & Platform Building Founded VEU AI Studio (4 AI platforms) and Afri Decarbonization Corporation. Consultant on NJ State Energy Security Plan. VEU AI Studio Launch ADC Foundation NJSESP Consultant (BPU) Click to see technical details & papers → Research Ecosystem Collaborative Partner Profiles Explore the leading researchers, institutions, and thought partners who shaped Dr. Udo's academic trajectory. Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD Associate Professor of Electrical & Computer Engineering Rowan University (formerly) → Bucknell University New Jersey / Pennsylvania, USA ResearchGate 15+ years of continuous collaboration spanning IEEE publications, renewable energy policy, and grid modernization. Research Focus Power systems, renewable energy, photovoltaic integration, grid engineering 6 Co-authored Papers 2003 Collaboration Started 23+ Years Active Key Publications • The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development (2003) • Integrating Large-Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid (2008) • The Challenges to Dam Removal on the Susquehanna River (2019) Prof. Artur Pawłowski, PhD Professor of Environmental Engineering Lublin University of Technology Lublin, Poland ResearchGate International collaboration on global sustainable development paradigms, published in Problems of Sustainable Development. Research Focus Sustainable development philosophy, ecological economics, S-Curve models 2 Co-authored Papers 2009 Collaboration Started 17+ Years Active Key Publications • Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration (2009) • Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development – Part II: Empirical Exploration (2011) Prof. Helen Bond, PhD Professor & Dean, School of Divinity Howard University Washington, DC, USA ResearchGate Collaboration at the intersection of faith, community leadership, and sustainable development at Howard University. Research Focus Theological education, community leadership, faith-based sustainable development, equity and justice 1 Co-authored Papers 2010 Collaboration Started 16+ Years Active Key Publications • Faith-Based Community Engagement and Sustainable Development (collaborative work) Prof. Ahmed Rubaai, PhD Professor of Electrical Engineering Howard University Washington, DC, USA ResearchGate Collaborated during Dr. Udo's graduate research at Howard University on adaptive hierarchical control for large-scale interconnected power systems. Research Focus Power electronics, electric motor drives, adaptive control systems, intelligent control 1 Co-authored Papers 1991 Collaboration Started 35+ Years Active Key Publications • An Adaptive Control Scheme for Load-Frequency Control of Multi-area Power Systems Parts I & II (1992) Ken T. Ogawa, PE, LEED AP, CEFP Associate Vice President of Administrative Services Bucknell University Lewisburg, Pennsylvania, USA Key institutional partner at Bucknell University in advancing campus sustainability, energy reduction, and the 10-year carbon neutrality plan. Research Focus Facilities management, sustainable campus operations, LEED-certified project leadership, energy efficiency, capital planning 1 Co-authored Papers 2019 Collaboration Started 7+ Years Active Key Publications • Collaborative leadership on Bucknell University's sustainability and carbon neutrality roadmap (2019–2025) Prof. Willett Kempton, PhD Director, Center for Carbon-Free Transportation University of Delaware Newark, Delaware, USA ResearchGate Co-led the world's first V2G grid demonstration — landmark publication with 415+ citations globally. Research Focus Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G), electric vehicles, grid integration, transportation electrification 1 Co-authored Papers 2008 Collaboration Started 18+ Years Active Key Publications • A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System (2008) Karen McGrath Working Group on Environmental Social and Governance (ESG) Education Bucknell University Lewisburg, Pennsylvania, USA Key partner in advancing ESG education and sustainability curriculum development at Bucknell University. Research Focus ESG education, sustainability curriculum, corporate responsibility, governance frameworks 0 Co-authored Papers 2019 Collaboration Started 7+ Years Active Key Publications • Collaborative leadership on ESG education initiatives as member of Bucknell's President's Sustainability Council Research Collaborations Academic Research Partnerships Peer-reviewed publications co-authored with Prof. Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University / Bucknell University), Prof. Artur Pawłowski, and other leading researchers — spanning sustainable development, grid integration, and global equity. Gubernatorial Appointment · State of New Jersey Member, New Jersey Renewable Energy Task Force Appointed by the Governor of New Jersey to the State's Renewable Energy Task Force — a distinction earned in recognition of Victor's expertise in electric power systems, grid infrastructure, and renewable energy integration during his tenure at Pepco Holdings (Conectiv / Atlantic Electric). This appointment placed him at the policy forefront of New Jersey's early clean energy transition, informing state-level decisions on renewable portfolio standards, utility restructuring, and grid modernization. His work on the Task Force directly preceded and shaped the academic research collaborations with Prof. Peter Mark Jansson at Rowan University, producing influential papers on PV grid integration and sustainable development. PhD Dissertation Committee · University of Delaware Member, PhD Dissertation Committee — Offshore Wind Power Research Appointed as a member of the PhD dissertation committee at the University of Delaware's College of Earth, Ocean, and Environment — overseeing a doctoral dissertation comprising four essays on offshore wind power: Potential, Development, Regulatory Framework, and Grid Integration . Victor's role brought the critical perspective of a senior utility executive (Pepco Holdings / Conectiv) who was simultaneously conducting live V2G experiments on the PJM grid, making him uniquely qualified to bridge academic research and real-world power system practice. Offshore Wind Potential Wind Farm Development Regulatory Framework Grid Integration BPU Contract · Rowan University · 2023–2025 Consultant, New Jersey State Energy Security Plan (NJSESP) Appointed as a consultant on the New Jersey State Energy Security Plan (NJSESP) — a contract awarded to the Rowan University Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering by the New Jersey Board of Public Utilities (BPU) . Victor served alongside Prof. Peter Mark Jansson and the Rowan engineering team, bringing decades of utility operations expertise — gained at Pepco Holdings, Conectiv, and Atlantic Electric — to inform New Jersey's statewide energy security strategy. The engagement represented a direct application of his career-long work at the intersection of electric power systems, grid reliability, and public policy. Energy Security Grid Reliability BPU Policy Utility Operations Public Policy Prof. Peter Mark Jansson, PhD Associate Professor of Electrical & Computer Engineering Rowan University (at time of collaboration) → Bucknell University Power systems, renewable energy, photovoltaic integration, grid engineering ResearchGate Profile Prof. Artur Pawłowski, PhD Professor of Environmental Engineering Lublin University of Technology, Poland Sustainable development philosophy, ecological economics, S-Curve models ResearchGate Profile Research Impact at a Glance 687+ Total Research Citations Across ResearchGate & Semantic Scholar 415+ V2G Paper Citations World's first grid demonstration 14 Peer-Reviewed Publications Journals, IEEE conferences & books 4 Countries in Collaboration USA · Poland · Nigeria · UK 33 Years of Academic Engagement 1992 IEE/IEEE publications to present 3 Lead Research Partners Jansson · Pawłowski · Kempton IEEE Conference Paper The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics (IEEE SMC) · Washington D.C., October 2003 Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University) · Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings / Conectiv) Co-authored during Victor's tenure as a member of the New Jersey Governor's Renewable Energy Task Force. The paper examined the structural role of the electric power industry as a driver of — or barrier to — global sustainable development, laying a conceptual framework later expanded in subsequent journal publications. Presented at IEEE's flagship Systems, Man, and Cybernetics conference in Washington D.C. DOI IEEE Conference Paper Integrating Large-Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid IEEE Energy 2030 Conference (IEEE ENERGY 2008) · November 2008 Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan) · Richard Michelfelder (Rutgers) · Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings) · Gary Sheehan · Michael Freeman + colleagues Examined how the U.S. electric power industry could reliably integrate large-scale dispersed renewable generators (wind and PV) as Renewable Portfolio Standards (RPS) were adopted across 26+ states. Documented the first PJM-connected utility-scale PV plant in Pennsylvania and analyzed how aggressive public policy and market forces shaped PV grid integration. ResearchGate DOI Peer-Reviewed Journal Bridging the Gaps for Global Sustainable Development: A Quantitative Analysis Journal of Environmental Management · Elsevier, Vol. 90, Issue 12, September 2009, pp. 3700–3707 Victor E. Udo (Pepco Holdings) · Peter Mark Jansson (Rowan University) A quantitative global study ranking 132 nations' sustainable development capacity across social, technological, and environmental dimensions. The study introduced an aggregate SD parameter and found a global hierarchy of needs among nations analogous to Maslow's individual hierarchy — demonstrating that nations struggling to survive prioritize social sustainability over environmental sustainability. ResearchGate DOI PubMed Peer-Reviewed Journal Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration Problems of Sustainable Development · Vol. 4, No. 2, pp. 23–44, 2009 Victor E. Udo · Artur Pawłowski (Lublin University of Technology, Poland) Proposed a new paradigm for understanding global human progress in the context of planetary sustainability. Applied the Cascaded–S Curve Model to explore how humanity's trajectory across society, technology, and the environment requires a systems-level rethink of global governance and development strategy. ResearchGate Peer-Reviewed Journal Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development – Part II: Empirical Exploration Problems of Sustainable Development · 2011 Victor E. Udo · Artur Pawłowski (Lublin University of Technology, Poland) Empirical companion to Part I — proposes a formal, operational definition of sustainable development and applies it to compare 132 national polities. Explores patterns and gaps in SD index performance, identifying how different governance and infrastructure contexts shape development trajectories. ResearchGate Conference Paper The Challenges to Dam Removal on the Susquehanna River: A Focus on Conowingo and PJM 14th Susquehanna River Symposium · Bucknell University, Lewisburg, Pennsylvania · October 18–19, 2019 Peter Mark Jansson (Bucknell University) · Victor E. Udo (Bucknell University) Investigated the energy, environmental, and grid reliability implications of removing the Conowingo Dam on the Susquehanna River — a critical PJM interconnection asset. Explored the balance between ecological restoration, hydroelectric power generation, and grid stability in the context of sustainable energy policy and river system management. Landmark Research · 415+ Citations Pioneering Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) Research 415+ Citations World's First V2G Grid Demo 2008 (revised January 2009) A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System Willett Kempton, Victor Udo, Ken Huber, Kevin Komara, Steve Letendre, Scott Baker, Doug Brunner & Nat Pearre University of Delaware / Pepco Holdings, Inc. / PJM Interconnect The world's first practical demonstration of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) power — providing real-time frequency regulation from an electric car to the PJM grid system. Victor Udo contributed as the Pepco Holdings representative, making this the first industry-utility proof of V2G at grid scale. The paper became a foundational reference for global EV-to-grid policy and clean energy transition strategy. Read on ResearchGate → Download PDF 415 Citations → Doctoral Research Dissertation Exploring Patterns of Sustainable Development, Governance and E-Infrastructure Capacities of Nations for Global Equity Praxis University of Delaware, 2003 Principal Advisor: Prof. Robert Warren, School of Urban Affairs and Public Policy 687+ research citations on ResearchGate View all publications → Explore Related Content About Dr. Victor Udo Books & Authored Works Research on ResearchGate Speaking & Thought Leadership VEU AI Studio News & Media Coverage Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation · Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025) Quick Links Home About Blog & Insights Books Speaking News Gallery Publications Contact Platforms & Organizations VEU AI Studio SAIGE Demo Afri Decarbonization Corp Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo Connect Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com +1 302 898 9542 LinkedIn Bucknell University Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025) Lewisburg, Pennsylvania #25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23) ~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved © 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved. ↑ Back to top","contentTruncated":{"html":false,"bodyText":false,"maxStoredHtmlBytes":250000,"maxStoredBodyTextBytes":50000},"contentLength":125624,"findings":[]},{"url":"https://victorudo.com/contact","depth":1,"status":"fetched","method":"browserless","httpStatus":null,"title":"Contact Dr. Victor Udo | Speaking, Advisory, VEU AI Studio & Abasi People Foundation","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/754a2285a_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n  <!-- Performance: Preconnect & DNS Prefetch -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <link href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <!-- Google Site Verification -->\n  <meta content=\"UPQLHTlymB5ijLSuhYAcOykBAhG7gB6gbBpg6n10KTA\" name=\"google-site-verification\">\n  <!-- Sitemap Discovery -->\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/sitemap\" rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\">\n  <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n  <title>Contact Dr. Victor Udo | Speaking, Advisory, VEU AI Studio &amp; Abasi People Foundation</title>\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"title\">\n  \n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, VEU AI Studio, SAIGE, sustainability, ESG, decarbonization, AI, Abasi Nation, Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, Obolo, Ndito Abasi, Abasians, Abasi People Foundation, Afri Decarbonization, carbon neutrality, Nigeria, Akwa Ibom, Bucknell University\" name=\"keywords\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" name=\"author\">\n  <meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\">\n  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n  <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/contact\" property=\"og:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" property=\"og:title\">\n  <meta content=\"profile\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo as Abasi Nation.\" property=\"og:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" property=\"og:image\">\n  <meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\">\n  <meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo\" property=\"og:site_name\">\n  <meta content=\"en_US\" property=\"og:locale\">\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/contact\" name=\"twitter:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"twitter:title\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation.\" name=\"twitter:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" name=\"twitter:image\">\n  <!-- Structured Data: Person -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n      \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"jobTitle\": \"AI Platform Builder, Decarbonization Champion\",\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorudo\",\n        \"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Decarbonization\", \"AI Platforms\", \"ESG\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Electric Power Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Public Policy\", \"Abasi Nation\"],\n      \"alumniOf\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Delaware\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Pennsylvania\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"Howard University\" }\n      ],\n      \"worksFor\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\", \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation\", \"url\": \"https://afridecarbonization.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Abasi People Foundation\", \"url\": \"https://abasipeople.org\" }\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Sustainability\", \"ESG\", \"Decarbonization\", \"Energy Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Abasi Nation\", \"Public Policy\", \"Corporate Governance\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: Organization (VEU AI Studio) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n      \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" },\n      \"description\": \"Agentic AI platforms for real-world decision intelligence — SAIGE (ESG/SDGs), RelTwin, ReachSMS, and PressAI.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\"https://veuaistudio.com\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: WebSite with SearchAction (enables Google Sitelinks Search Box) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"description\": \"Official website of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI Builder, Sustainability Leader, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\n      \"potentialAction\": {\n        \"@type\": \"SearchAction\",\n        \"target\": {\n          \"@type\": \"EntryPoint\",\n          \"urlTemplate\": \"https://victorudo.com/news?q={search_term_string}\"\n        },\n        \"query-input\": \"required name=search_term_string\"\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: FAQ (common searches about Victor Udo) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Dr. Victor Udo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is an AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is SAIGE by VEU AI Studio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"SAIGE is an agentic AI platform for enterprise decision intelligence on ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and sustainability governance. It provides real-time analytics and impact assessment for organizations managing sustainability targets and carbon neutrality goals.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Abasi People Foundation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Abasi People Foundation, founded by Dr. Victor Udo, is a movement uniting seven peoples — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo — as Abasi Nation, the 4th largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria with vision for sustainable development and unity.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is Afri Decarbonization Corporation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), led by Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD as Chairman/CEO, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What topics does Dr. Victor Udo speak on?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD speaks on AI for enterprise decisions, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I book Dr. Victor Udo for a speaking engagement?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use the contact form at victorudo.com/contact and select 'Speaking Engagement' as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" } as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Dr. Udo personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are Dr. Victor Udo's published books?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is author of 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" } 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Bucknell Carbon Neutrality initiative?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD led the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" } the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: LocalBusiness (Lewisburg Office) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader. Consulting and advisory services for ESG, decarbonization, and enterprise AI decision intelligence.\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Lewisburg\",\n        \"addressRegion\": \"PA\",\n        \"postalCode\": \"17837\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-570-577-1234\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\n        \"Artificial Intelligence\",\n        \"Enterprise AI\",\n        \"Sustainability\",\n        \"ESG Governance\",\n        \"Decarbonization\",\n        \"Carbon Markets\",\n        \"Energy Transition\",\n        \"Corporate Leadership\",\n        \"Public Policy\",\n        \"African Development\"\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: ProfessionalService (Consulting & Advisory) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — Sustainability & AI Consulting\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n        \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n        \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n        \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\"\n      },\n      \"serviceType\": [\"Advisory Services\", \"Strategic Consulting\", \"ESG Governance\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Enterprise AI Decision Intelligence\"],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"description\": \"Executive advisory and strategic consulting services for organizations pursuing carbon neutrality, ESG excellence, and AI-enabled decision intelligence.\"\n    }\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-R2wm1Vio.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/index-DUFtFU2C.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\">\n   if (window.self === window.top) {\n  let lastPath = \"\";\n  function getPageNameFromPath(path) {\n    const segments = path.split(\"/\").filter(Boolean);\n    return segments[0] || null;\n  }\n  function trackPageView() {\n    const path = window.location.pathname;\n    if (path === lastPath) return;\n    lastPath = path;\n    const pageName = getPageNameFromPath(path) || \"home\";\n    const appId = \"69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf\";\n    if (!appId) return;\n    fetch(`/api/app-logs/${appId}/log-user-in-app/${pageName}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n    }).catch(() => {});\n  }\n  const originalPushState = history.pushState.bind(history);\n  history.pushState = function (...args) {\n    originalPushState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  const originalReplaceState = history.replaceState.bind(history);\n  history.replaceState = function (...args) {\n    originalReplaceState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener(\"popstate\", trackPageView);\n  trackPageView();\n}\n  </script>\n  <meta content=\"yes\" name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\">\n  <meta content=\"black\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\">\n  <meta content=\"VictorUdo.Com\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\">\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/contact\" rel=\"canonical\">\n  <script data-seo-source=\"builder\" type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"contact\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/contact\"}]}\n  </script>\n <meta content=\"Contact Dr. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — for speaking engagements on AI, sustainability, and leadership; advisory and consulting services; VEU AI Studio partnerships; Afri Decarbonization Corporation project inquiries; and Abasi People Foundation engagement. Every message receives a personal response.\" name=\"description\"><script type=\"application/ld+json