0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder - Sustainability Leader - Abasi Foundation Leader - Power Sector Executive Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × Engineer. Executive. Community Leader. AI Builder. Speaker. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI platform builder, sustainability leader, electric power sector executive, and Abasi People Movement champion with 25+ years of impact across business, government, and academia. Building AI Platforms for Individual and Organizational Impacts Explore My Platforms View My Books Background image taken during a speaking engagement 0+ Years of Transformational Leadership 0 AI Platforms Built & Launching ~30% Carbon Reduction at Bucknell 0.76 MW Solar Farm at Bucknell 0.8M Hectares Under ADC MOU (1.6M Forest + 200K Agriculture) 0 Abasi Peoples Unity 0M+ Media Reach — POL Radio & TV, Akwa Ibom (2012–2019) ~700MW Ibom Power Capacity Licensed ~155MW Ibom Power Macro-Grid Island 0 Peer-Reviewed Publications 0+ Citations ~3,500 Reads What Victor Does Five Dimensions of Impact AI Platform Builder Founder of VEU AI Studio, building 4 AI SaaS platforms serving enterprise sustainability, relationship intelligence, community engagement, and publishing. Explore the Platforms Decarbonization Leader Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, focused on practical pathways to net-zero for organizations and governments across West Africa. Learn About ADC Sustainability Leader Author of 3 books and 14 papers. Former Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, chairing the President's Sustainability Council toward carbon neutrality by 2030. View Books & Research Executive Advisor 25+ years spanning Fortune 500 energy companies (Pepco Holdings), government (Akwa Ibom State), and academic leadership across the USA and Nigeria. Advisory Services Abasian Nationality Champion President of the Abasi People Foundation, uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, and Obolo peoples under a shared vision of belonging and sustainable development. About the Foundation Career Milestones Atlantic City Electric Conectiv Power Delivery Pepco Holdings (now part of Exelon) Ibom Power Akwa Ibom State Government Bucknell University University of Delaware University of Pennsylvania Howard University Global Impact Work Across Two Continents Explore Dr. Victor Udo's projects, initiatives, and leadership across the USA and West Africa — from decarbonization and energy policy to sustainability and community empowerment. 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 📍 + − Leaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors © CARTO Impact Zones Nigeria / Decarbonization US Energy & PJM Grid US Academia & Sustainability Poland / International Research Europe / Energy & Innovation Current Work — AI Platforms VEU AI Studio — Intelligent Platforms for Real-World Impact Victor is the Founder of VEU AI Studio, a portfolio of AI Platforms designed for organizations that need to move from information to knowledge to decisions to measurable real-world impact. Four agentic AI platforms are in active development and commercialization. Information Knowledge Decisions Impact 🔵 Launching Soon SAIGE Enterprise AI platform for ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and Sustainability governance. Introduces Enterprise Impact Performance (EIP) — a unified intelligence layer for people, planet, and progress. Learn More 🔵 Launching Soon RelTwin Relationship intelligence platform using Relationship Digital Twins (RDT) to improve organizational leadership, communication, and performance. Learn More 🔵 Launching Soon ReachSMS SMS-first community management and connections infrastructure for online communities, value exchange, and services. Learn More 🔵 Launching Soon PressAI Virtual end-to-end publishing and knowledge-sharing infrastructure — amplifying underrepresented voices through AI-powered content creation. Learn More Explore All Platforms Every organisation is accountable for the impact it creates on society. Most are still flying blind. SAIGE is an Agentic AI platform that unifies ESG, Sustainability, SDGs, EHS and CSR into a single Enterprise Impact Performance (EIP) score — giving executives, domain leaders, and practitioners the tools and intelligence to make the best decisions and act responsibly across People, Planet, Peace, Progress, and Profits. GET EARLY ACCESS Start Your Enterprise Impact Performance (EIP) Journey with SAIGE Enter your email to access the full 6-step workflow. Start the Demo → Or join the waitlist with your email THE PROBLEM Why SAIGE Matters 68% of ESG reports contain material errors due to manual, disconnected processes MSCI ESG Survey, 2023 73% of sustainability leaders say fragmented data makes board-level reporting harder MIT Sloan, 2023 40% reduction in compliance costs for orgs with unified impact intelligence within 18 months Deloitte Insights 2023 6+ disconnected tools the average organisation uses for ESG, EHS, SDGs, CSR & Sustainability Gartner, 2024 LIVE DEMO High Level SAIGE Animation School University Local Gov Gov Agency Business NGO Problem: Aging water infrastructure, fleet emissions non-compliance, declining public satisfaction. Local Government 65 Above average Sustainability 81 ESG 56 SDGs 78 EHS 68 CSR 60 Data is synthetic. Only for demo purposes. View Demo Visit SAIGE Nature-Based Decarbonization Decarbonizing Africa through Nature-Based Solutions Victor is the Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC) — a nature-based carbon enterprise reforesting and regenerating West Africa through nature-based decarbonization strategies. ADC has signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with the Cross River State Government of Nigeria covering 1.8 million hectares total - 1.6 million hectares of forest for carbon sink and biodiversity, and 200,000 hectares for regenerative agriculture. Forest Carbon Sink 1.6 million hectares of forest under MOU with Cross River State for carbon sequestration and biodiversity conservation. Regenerative Agriculture 200,000 hectares of bamboo and food crop regenerative agriculture — creating small farming community-driven decarbonization and export-oriented processing. Community Impact Poverty alleviation, ESG and SDGs implementation, and DEIJ outcomes — ensuring \"no one is left behind\" across beneficiary communities. Learn About ADC Academic Leadership Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University As Chairman of the President's Sustainability Council at Bucknell University (2019–2025), Victor led strategic planning and execution of a comprehensive 10-year carbon neutrality roadmap, achieving nearly 30% emissions reduction from a 2008 baseline while advancing zero waste initiatives, ecological conservation, and ESG outcomes aligned with the University's Strategic Plan. ~30% Carbon footprint reduction vs. 2008 baseline #25 Ranked among Top 50 Green Universities in the USA 2030 Target year for Bucknell carbon neutrality Pioneering Research · 2008 The World's First Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) Real-World Demonstration In 2008, Victor Udo — representing Pepco Holdings — co-led the landmark study proving electric vehicles could power the grid in real time, providing live frequency regulation to the PJM Interconnection. Co-authored with Prof. Willett Kempton (University of Delaware) and PJM engineers, it has since been cited 415+ times globally. 415+ Academic Citations 2008 Year Published PJM Grid System Tested 1st Real-World V2G Demo \"V2G, in addition to providing valuable grid services, could also prove to be a prominent application in the global transition to the emerging green and sustainable energy economy.\" — Kempton, Udo et al., 2008 · University of Delaware / Pepco Holdings / PJM Interconnect Why This Matters Today V2G technology is now central to global net-zero strategies — from the EU's Vehicle-to-Grid directive to US DOE grid modernization policy. Victor's foundational 2008 research helped lay the scientific and commercial groundwork for this multi-billion dollar industry, making EVs active participants in grid stability. Study Results & Figures Key charts, graphs, and data visualizations from the published paper Frequency regulation signal vs. economic dispatch — showing V2G's rapid-response advantage over conventional generators Hourly contracted regulation and the regulation dispatch requirement (PACE signal) for the California ISO Discounted present value of gross revenues generated from selling regulation and spinning reserve at varying power levels V2GCAR1 shown as a generator on PJM's SCADA system — plugged in and responding to PJM's encrypted control signal Real-time regulation dispatch signal and V2G vehicle response — demonstrating precise bidirectional power control Measured V2G power output tracking the regulation signal during the live PJM frequency regulation test Revenue projections for V2G frequency regulation service across different fleet sizes and market scenarios Average annual market clearing prices for spinning reserve across five US grid operators (2004–2006) Read the Paper on ResearchGate Download PDF 415+ Citations Professional Journey From Grid to Global Impact Three decades of leadership — from power systems engineering and utility executive roles to renewable energy policy, academic research, and AI platform building. Career Arc Interactive Career Timeline Click any era to explore detailed achievements and impact. 1984–1991 Foundation Era Early Career & Education Started as a Technical Supervisor in Nigeria, then pursued graduate education in the US. Built expertise in power systems and energy management while supporting leading research initiatives. Click to see full details → 1991–2006 Corporate Rise Utilities Executive Leadership Click to see full details → 2006–2012 Public Policy Era From Utility Sector to Policy Innovation Click to see full details → 2012–2019 African Public Service Government Leadership & Nation Building Click to see full details → 2019–2025 Academic & Sustainability Leadership Bucknell University & Climate Action Click to see full details → 2020–Present Founding & Impact Era AI Platforms, Decarbonization & Community Click to see full details → Career Milestones A Career at the Intersection of Power, Policy & Purpose With Vice President Joe Biden, 2008 Discussing Nigeria's Power Sector with Alhaji Dangote With US Senator Chris Coons in Lagos With Governor Akpabio of Akwa Ibom State at Washington DC, 2011 Community Leadership Uniting the Abasi Nation — People, Planet, Progress Victor is the Founding Chairman, President, and CEO of the Abasi People Foundation (APF) — leading the Abasi People Movement to unite the Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid and Obolo peoples — the fourth largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria — for collective self-emancipation and equitable sustainable development in Nigeria and the global diaspora. Mission Unite Ndito Abasi for collective self-emancipation from marginalization and exploitation, towards equitable sustainable development. Advocacy Active engagement with traditional rulers, governors, senators, and federal institutions. Reach Non-partisan, non-religious movement with chapters across Nigeria and diaspora in Africa, America, Asia, Europe, and the Middle East. Learn More Author Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development Structural & Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation Who Is Victor Udo Transformational Engineer. Global Executive. AI Builder. Victor Udo, PhD, FNSE brings together an extraordinary range of experience — from managing a $2B risk portfolio at Pepco Holdings, to serving as CEO of a 200+ employee company with a 700 MW power plant license, to being appointed to boards by a US Senator and a New Jersey Governor, to leading Bucknell University's carbon neutrality journey, to building a nature-based decarbonization enterprise in West Africa. He is the Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation and the Founder of VEU AI Studio — channeling 25+ years of cross-sector executive leadership into platforms and movements that create measurable real-world impact. Read Full Bio Publications Books by Dr. Victor Udo Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership and Equitable Sustainable Development Navigates post-colonial political and diplomatic conditions, class structure, economic organization, Nigerian culture, ethnic diversity, and the environment. Prescribed reading for Nigerian students, policymakers, and civil servants. Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation This book presents the electric power sector as AC and DC systems managed by a value constellation of stakeholders. The domain set for global sustainability and technological convergence are explored, presenting a pathway forward through decarbonization enabled by digitalization and decentralization. Sustainability Insights on the simultaneously evolutionary and revolutionary processes that are helping the global and Nigerian energy sectors move forward by using Nigeria as a metaphor of understanding. Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development The book is based on 7 years of direct observations, participation and engagement in the development system from the villages, wards, LGAs, States and country. After over 25 years away from home as a student of American education and corporate experience, Victor returned home as a student to capture the structural, leadership and development challenges in the country and prescribes a way forward. There is an urgent need for true transformation starting at the grassroots community level and smartphone democracy for comprehensive sustainable development planning and implementation. Trusted by Leaders, Institutions & Communities Appointed to the Delaware Planning Board — by eventual US Senator Chris Coons Appointed to the NJ Renewable Energy Task Force — by the Governor of New Jersey Bucknell ranked #25, Top 50 Green Universities — under Victor's Sustainability Council leadership Royal Endorsement of the Abasi People Movement — HRM Odidem Bassey Etim Edet, Chairman, Akwa Ibom State Traditional Rulers Council Press In the News Bucknell Student Blog — Margaret Hunter Dr. Victor Udo Brings University Sustainability Efforts to Light February 2024 Bucknell ENLS 103 Blog Dr. Udo — Sustainability at Bucknell and Beyond February 2024 Bucknell University News Bucknell Repeats STARS Gold Rating for Sustainability July 2023 NorthCentralPA.com New Solar Field to Provide Bucknell Nearly 10% of University Power October 2022 Business Day Nigeria Ibom Power Company Gets New MD — Victor Udo Reassigned to Governor's Office August 2016 The Nigerian Voice Governor Udom Emmanuel Will Revolutionize Akwa Ibom Power Sector November 2015 See All Press Coverage Stay Updated Get the latest news on sustainability initiatives, AI platforms, and the Abasi People movement directly to your inbox. Subscribe We respect your privacy. Unsubscribe at any time. Let's Work Together Whether you're exploring a partnership with VEU AI Studio, ADC nature-based projects, advisory support, speaking invitations, or connection with the Abasi People Foundation — reach out directly. Get in Touch Explore VEU AI Studio Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation · Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025) Quick Links Home About Blog & Insights Books Speaking News Gallery Publications Contact Platforms & Organizations VEU AI Studio SAIGE Demo Afri Decarbonization Corp Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo Connect Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com +1 302 898 9542 LinkedIn Bucknell University Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025) Lewisburg, Pennsylvania #25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23) ~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved © 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved. ↑ Back to top","contentTruncated":{"html":false,"bodyText":false,"maxStoredHtmlBytes":250000,"maxStoredBodyTextBytes":50000},"contentLength":136738,"findings":[]},{"url":"https://victorudo.com/about","depth":1,"status":"fetched","method":"browserless","httpStatus":null,"title":"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | About | Howard, UPenn, Delaware, Bucknell","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/754a2285a_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n  <!-- Performance: Preconnect & DNS Prefetch -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <link href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <!-- Google Site Verification -->\n  <meta content=\"UPQLHTlymB5ijLSuhYAcOykBAhG7gB6gbBpg6n10KTA\" name=\"google-site-verification\">\n  <!-- Sitemap Discovery -->\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/sitemap\" rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\">\n  <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n  <title>Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | About | Howard, UPenn, Delaware, Bucknell</title>\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"title\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI builder, sustainability executive, public servant. Education: Howard University (ME, BSEE), University of Pennsylvania (MSc), University of Delaware (PhD). Former Director of Sustainability, Bucknell University. Leadership roles: Akwa Ibom State, Nigeria. Founder VEU AI Studio, Afri Decarbonization Corporation, Abasi People Foundation. CME Church board member.\" name=\"description\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo, Victor Udo FNSE PhD, Howard University, University of Pennsylvania, University of Delaware, Bucknell University, Akwa Ibom, Nigeria, CME Church, sustainability leader, AI builder, engineer, executive\" name=\"keywords\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" name=\"author\">\n  <meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\">\n  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n  <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/about\" property=\"og:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" property=\"og:title\">\n  <meta content=\"profile\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo as Abasi Nation.\" property=\"og:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" property=\"og:image\">\n  <meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\">\n  <meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo\" property=\"og:site_name\">\n  <meta content=\"en_US\" property=\"og:locale\">\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/about\" name=\"twitter:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"twitter:title\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation.\" name=\"twitter:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" name=\"twitter:image\">\n  <!-- Structured Data: Person -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n      \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"jobTitle\": \"AI Platform Builder, Decarbonization Champion\",\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorudo\",\n        \"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Decarbonization\", \"AI Platforms\", \"ESG\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Electric Power Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Public Policy\", \"Abasi Nation\"],\n      \"alumniOf\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Delaware\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Pennsylvania\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"Howard University\" }\n      ],\n      \"worksFor\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\", \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation\", \"url\": \"https://afridecarbonization.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Abasi People Foundation\", \"url\": \"https://abasipeople.org\" }\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Sustainability\", \"ESG\", \"Decarbonization\", \"Energy Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Abasi Nation\", \"Public Policy\", \"Corporate Governance\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: Organization (VEU AI Studio) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n      \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" },\n      \"description\": \"Agentic AI platforms for real-world decision intelligence — SAIGE (ESG/SDGs), RelTwin, ReachSMS, and PressAI.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\"https://veuaistudio.com\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: WebSite with SearchAction (enables Google Sitelinks Search Box) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"description\": \"Official website of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI Builder, Sustainability Leader, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\n      \"potentialAction\": {\n        \"@type\": \"SearchAction\",\n        \"target\": {\n          \"@type\": \"EntryPoint\",\n          \"urlTemplate\": \"https://victorudo.com/news?q={search_term_string}\"\n        },\n        \"query-input\": \"required name=search_term_string\"\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: FAQ (common searches about Victor Udo) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Dr. Victor Udo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is an AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is SAIGE by VEU AI Studio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"SAIGE is an agentic AI platform for enterprise decision intelligence on ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and sustainability governance. It provides real-time analytics and impact assessment for organizations managing sustainability targets and carbon neutrality goals.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Abasi People Foundation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Abasi People Foundation, founded by Dr. Victor Udo, is a movement uniting seven peoples — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo — as Abasi Nation, the 4th largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria with vision for sustainable development and unity.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is Afri Decarbonization Corporation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), led by Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD as Chairman/CEO, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What topics does Dr. Victor Udo speak on?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD speaks on AI for enterprise decisions, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I book Dr. Victor Udo for a speaking engagement?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use the contact form at victorudo.com/contact and select 'Speaking Engagement' as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" } as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Dr. Udo personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are Dr. Victor Udo's published books?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is author of 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" } 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Bucknell Carbon Neutrality initiative?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD led the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" } the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: LocalBusiness (Lewisburg Office) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader. Consulting and advisory services for ESG, decarbonization, and enterprise AI decision intelligence.\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Lewisburg\",\n        \"addressRegion\": \"PA\",\n        \"postalCode\": \"17837\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-570-577-1234\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\n        \"Artificial Intelligence\",\n        \"Enterprise AI\",\n        \"Sustainability\",\n        \"ESG Governance\",\n        \"Decarbonization\",\n        \"Carbon Markets\",\n        \"Energy Transition\",\n        \"Corporate Leadership\",\n        \"Public Policy\",\n        \"African Development\"\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: ProfessionalService (Consulting & Advisory) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — Sustainability & AI Consulting\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n        \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n        \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n        \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\"\n      },\n      \"serviceType\": [\"Advisory Services\", \"Strategic Consulting\", \"ESG Governance\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Enterprise AI Decision Intelligence\"],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"description\": \"Executive advisory and strategic consulting services for organizations pursuing carbon neutrality, ESG excellence, and AI-enabled decision intelligence.\"\n    }\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-R2wm1Vio.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/index-DUFtFU2C.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\">\n   if (window.self === window.top) {\n  let lastPath = \"\";\n  function getPageNameFromPath(path) {\n    const segments = path.split(\"/\").filter(Boolean);\n    return segments[0] || null;\n  }\n  function trackPageView() {\n    const path = window.location.pathname;\n    if (path === lastPath) return;\n    lastPath = path;\n    const pageName = getPageNameFromPath(path) || \"home\";\n    const appId = \"69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf\";\n    if (!appId) return;\n    fetch(`/api/app-logs/${appId}/log-user-in-app/${pageName}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n    }).catch(() => {});\n  }\n  const originalPushState = history.pushState.bind(history);\n  history.pushState = function (...args) {\n    originalPushState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  const originalReplaceState = history.replaceState.bind(history);\n  history.replaceState = function (...args) {\n    originalReplaceState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener(\"popstate\", trackPageView);\n  trackPageView();\n}\n  </script>\n  <meta content=\"yes\" name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\">\n  <meta content=\"black\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\">\n  <meta content=\"VictorUdo.Com\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\">\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/about\" rel=\"canonical\">\n  <script data-seo-source=\"builder\" type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"about\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/about\"}]}\n  </script>\n <script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-schema=\"breadcrumb-schema\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://victorudo.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"About Dr. Victor Udo\",\"item\":\"https://victorudo.com/about\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-schema=\"webpage-schema\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"About Dr. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\"description\":\"Biography and professional profile of Dr. Victor Udo — AI Builder, Sustainability Executive, Afri Decarbonization Chairman/CEO, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\"url\":\"https://victorudo.com/about\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"url\":\"https://victorudo.com\",\"name\":\"Dr. Victor Udo\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://victorudo.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"About\",\"item\":\"https://victorudo.com/about\"}]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-schema=\"faq-schema\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where did Dr. Victor Udo study?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo earned a PhD in Urban Affairs and Public Policy from the University of Delaware, an MSc in Energy Management & Environmental Policy from the University of Pennsylvania (UPenn), and degrees in Electrical Engineering (ME and BSEE) from Howard University.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Dr. Victor Udo's connection to Bucknell University?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo served as Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University (2019–2025), where he led the development of a comprehensive 10-year carbon neutrality roadmap, achieving nearly 30% emissions reduction and contributing to the university's ranking among the top 50 green institutions in the United States.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What government roles has Dr. Victor Udo held in Nigeria?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo served in Akwa Ibom State Government, Nigeria, as Senior Special Assistant to the Governor on Power (2012–2014) and Senior Special Assistant to the Governor on Planning (2016–2019). He also served as CEO of Ibom Power Company Ltd (2014–2016).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Dr. Victor Udo's background?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo has 25+ years of executive leadership across engineering, energy, sustainability, AI, and public policy in the US and West Africa. He holds a PhD from the University of Delaware and is a Fellow of the Nigerian Society of Engineers (FNSE).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What companies does Dr. Victor Udo lead?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo is Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What AI platforms has Dr. Victor Udo built?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Dr. Victor Udo has built four AI platforms through VEU AI Studio: SAIGE (ESG/Sustainability intelligence), RelTwin (relationship science), ReachSMS (community management), and PressAI (knowledge publishing).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Dr. Victor Udo affiliated with the CME Church?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Dr. Victor Udo serves as a General Connectional Board Member of the CME (Christian Methodist Episcopal) Church, which has over 1,000 congregations in the USA and Africa.\"}}]}</script></head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"transition-all duration-500 bg-primary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"f