ss=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">VEU AI Studio</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white bg-white/15\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People</a><div class=\"absolute left-0 mt-0 w-52 bg-primary border border-white/20 rounded-lg shadow-lg opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-200 z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People Foundation</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></div></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><a title=\"Carbon Footprint Calculator\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/carbon-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></a><a title=\"Dr. Udo's Banner &amp; Profile Summary\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-user-round h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 21a6 6 0 0 0-12 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"4\"></circle><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></a><div class=\"relative hidden xl:block\"><button title=\"Search books, news...\" class=\"px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative group\"><button class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\">More ▾</button><div class=\"absolute right-0 mt-0 w-52 bg-primary border border-white/20 rounded-lg shadow-lg opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-200 z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/carbon-calculator\">Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Afri Decarbonization</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/advisory\">Advisory Services</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/news\">News</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/mothers-memorial\">Mother's Memorial</a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 sm:px-6 h-9 sm:h-10 rounded-lg shadow-md\">Work With Victor</button></a><button class=\"lg:hidden text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></div><div class=\"fixed top-16 lg:top-20 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-accent text-accent-foreground flex items-center justify-center py-1.5 px-8\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold hover:underline flex-1 text-center\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\">View Dr. Udo's Profile &amp; Banner Summary →</a><button class=\"absolute right-3 text-accent-foreground/70 hover:text-accent-foreground text-base leading-none\" aria-label=\"Dismiss\">×</button></div><main class=\"flex-1 pt-24 lg:pt-28 transition-all duration-300\"><div><div class=\"relative bg-primary text-white py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-accent/[0.07]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h1 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">Abasi People Foundation</h1><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Uniting the peoples of southeastern Nigeria under a shared vision of belonging, sustainable development, and collective progress.</p></div></div><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.798516px);\">Our People</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3.70305px);\">Abasi People (Ndito Abasi)</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.ibibiopeoplesunion.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Ibibio</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anaang_people\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Annang</a><a href=\"https://efikeburutu.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Efik</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oron_people\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Oro</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Ekid</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoi_people\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Ekoi</a><a href=\"https://www.obololanguage.org/en/obolo-people/who-are-obolo-people\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/80 transition-colors\">Obolo</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-secondary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Our Mission</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Our Mission</h2></div><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center text-base\">The Abasi People Foundation exists to unite the Abasi peoples — bound by shared history, language roots, and geography across southeastern Nigeria — in pursuit of sustainable development, cultural preservation, and equitable progress. Under the presidency of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD, the Foundation bridges diaspora and homeland through advocacy, education, and community investment.</p></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\" mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Origin</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">A Movement Born of Purpose</h2></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl space-y-5 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\"><p>The Abasi People Movement was born during the COVID-19 pandemic in 2020, when Dr. Victor Udo convened an online community to confront both internal and external forces of exploitation facing the Abasi peoples. What began as a digital gathering evolved into a formal, non-partisan, non-religious organisation: the Abasi People Foundation (APF).</p><p>The Abasi Nation — comprising the Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, and Obolo peoples (Ndito Abasi) — is the fourth largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria, spanning Akwa Ibom (Uyo, Ikot Ekpene, Obot Akara, Ibeno, Eket, Oron, Itu) and Cross River (Calabar) states. The APF exists to unite these seven peoples across Nigeria and the global diaspora for collective self-emancipation, cultural affirmation, and equitable sustainable development.</p><p>Victor was unanimously elected Founding Chairman/President/CEO by the founding Steering Group.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-secondary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Foundation</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Mission, Shared Identity &amp; Values</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Mission</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">To unite Ndito Abasi — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, and Obolo — for collective and individual self-emancipation from internal and external marginalization and exploitation, towards equitable sustainable development.</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Shared Identity</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">The Abasi peoples share the name of God — \"Abasi\" — as their unifying cultural and spiritual identity. This shared heritage is the foundation of the Movement's call to unity, dignity, and collective progress. \"Yak Akwa Abasi Ibom odiong kpukpuru nnyin.\"</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Values</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Unity · Self-Determination · Dignity · Equitable Development · Democratic Governance · Cultural Pride</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Activities</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Key Activities</h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crown h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.734H5.81a1 1 0 0 1-.957-.734L2.02 6.02a.5.5 0 0 1 .798-.519l4.276 3.664a1 1 0 0 0 1.516-.294z\"></path><path d=\"M5 21h14\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Traditional Leadership Engagement</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Courtesy visits to paramount rulers and traditional councils. HRM Odidem Bassey Etim Edet, Chairman, Akwa Ibom State Traditional Rulers Council, endorsed the Movement and agreed to serve as patron.</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scale h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"m16 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"m2 16 3-8 3 8c-.87.65-1.92 1-3 1s-2.13-.35-3-1Z\"></path><path d=\"M7 21h10\"></path><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h2c2 0 5-1 7-2 2 1 5 2 7 2h2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Political &amp; Policy Advocacy</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Advocating for dialogue between Cross River and Akwa Ibom governors on the 76 oil wells dispute; pushing for Gulf of Guinea deep seaport development.</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">National Governance Positions</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Formally rejected the proposed Southern Nigeria Traditional Rulers Council as exclusionary. Position: \"Justice demands representation, peace requires equality, and development begins with dignity.\"</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Diaspora Organisation</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Building chapters across Africa, America, Asia, Europe, and the Middle East.</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Youth &amp; Women Empowerment</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Programmes supporting girl-children's education, sanitary health, women's leadership, and youth development.</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-7 shadow-sm border border-border/50 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\">Digital Democracy</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">\"Operational citizenship\" and \"smartphone democracy\" through the Abasians OnLine (AOL) initiative.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-secondary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Recent</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Recent Actions</h2></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-card rounded-lg p-8 shadow-sm border border-border/50 mb-12\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">In February 2026, the Abasi People Foundation issued a formal public statement demanding equal representation for all indigenous southern nationalities in any traditional governance council structure in Nigeria — in solidarity with Igbo traditional rulers who raised similar concerns. APF's position: justice demands representation, peace requires equality, and development begins with dignity.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-secondary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Leadership</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Founding Executive Leadership</h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Dr. Victor Udo</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Founding Chairman / President / CEO</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ibibio, Obot Akara LGA / USA Diaspora</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Barrister Orok Okon</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Deputy Chairman, Legal &amp; Administration</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Efik</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Engr. Etim Asuquo</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Deputy Chairman, Liaison</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ibibio</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Dr. Idara Umoette</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Secretary General</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ibibio</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Mr. Joe Idiong</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">VP, Treasury &amp; Diaspora Affairs</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Annang</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Ms. Favour Uweh</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Deputy Secretary, Media</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Oro</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Mr. Victor Akai</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Deputy Secretary, Recording &amp; Documentation / Chief Whip</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ekid</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Barrister Egwu Egwu</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">Deputy Secretary, Logistics / Organising &amp; Protocol</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ekoi</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Barrister Sunday Afiko</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">VP, Youth Affairs</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Obolo</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Dr. Grace Akpanika</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">VP, Women Affairs</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Efik</p></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm border border-border/50\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\">Engr. Emmanuel Udo</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-medium mt-1\">VP, Process Enforcement / Chief of Staff</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Ibibio</p></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-12\"><a href=\"https://abasipeople.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold px-8 h-12 text-base rounded-lg shadow-md\">Visit the Abasi People Foundation <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Get Involved</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px);\">Get Involved</h2></div><form class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-5\"><input required=\"\" placeholder=\"Name\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"><input required=\"\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-4 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"><textarea required=\"\" placeholder=\"How you'd like to contribute\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring resize-none\"></textarea><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow px-4 py-2 w-full bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold h-11 rounded-lg\" type=\"submit\">Connect With the Foundation</button></form></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center bg-secondary rounded-lg p-12\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\">Listen to the Abasi People Forum Podcast</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8\">28 episodes of direct, issue-centric dialogue on governance, unity, emancipation, and equitable development for Ndito Abasi. New episodes weekly.</p><a href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold px-8 h-12 rounded-lg\">Visit the Podcast Page →</button></a></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-1\">Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD</h3><p class=\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Engineer</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Executive</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">AI Builder</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Author</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Community Leader</a></p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\"><a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">Founder, VEU AI Studio</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/afri-decarbonization\">Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation</a> · <a class=\"underline decoration-white/30 hover:text-white hover:decoration-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025)</a></p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Quick Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Books</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Platforms &amp; Organizations</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"https://veuaistudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">VEU AI Studio<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://saigedemo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">SAIGE Demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://afridecarbonization.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Afri Decarbonization Corp<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"https://abasipeople.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">Abasi People Foundation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></li><li><a href=\"https://anchor.fm/sustainability-leadership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1\">The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-2.5 w-2.5\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"Abasi People Foundation | Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, Obolo & Abasians Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × Abasi People Foundation Uniting the peoples of southeastern Nigeria under a shared vision of belonging, sustainable development, and collective progress. Our People Abasi People (Ndito Abasi) Ibibio Annang Efik Oro Ekid Ekoi Obolo Our Mission Our Mission The Abasi People Foundation exists to unite the Abasi peoples — bound by shared history, language roots, and geography across southeastern Nigeria — in pursuit of sustainable development, cultural preservation, and equitable progress. Under the presidency of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD, the Foundation bridges diaspora and homeland through advocacy, education, and community investment. Origin A Movement Born of Purpose The Abasi People Movement was born during the COVID-19 pandemic in 2020, when Dr. Victor Udo convened an online community to confront both internal and external forces of exploitation facing the Abasi peoples. What began as a digital gathering evolved into a formal, non-partisan, non-religious organisation: the Abasi People Foundation (APF). The Abasi Nation — comprising the Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, and Obolo peoples (Ndito Abasi) — is the fourth largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria, spanning Akwa Ibom (Uyo, Ikot Ekpene, Obot Akara, Ibeno, Eket, Oron, Itu) and Cross River (Calabar) states. The APF exists to unite these seven peoples across Nigeria and the global diaspora for collective self-emancipation, cultural affirmation, and equitable sustainable development. Victor was unanimously elected Founding Chairman/President/CEO by the founding Steering Group. Foundation Mission, Shared Identity & Values Mission To unite Ndito Abasi — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekid, Ekoi, and Obolo — for collective and individual self-emancipation from internal and external marginalization and exploitation, towards equitable sustainable development. Shared Identity The Abasi peoples share the name of God — \"Abasi\" — as their unifying cultural and spiritual identity. This shared heritage is the foundation of the Movement's call to unity, dignity, and collective progress. \"Yak Akwa Abasi Ibom odiong kpukpuru nnyin.\" Values Unity · Self-Determination · Dignity · Equitable Development · Democratic Governance · Cultural Pride Activities Key Activities Traditional Leadership Engagement Courtesy visits to paramount rulers and traditional councils. HRM Odidem Bassey Etim Edet, Chairman, Akwa Ibom State Traditional Rulers Council, endorsed the Movement and agreed to serve as patron. Political & Policy Advocacy Advocating for dialogue between Cross River and Akwa Ibom governors on the 76 oil wells dispute; pushing for Gulf of Guinea deep seaport development. National Governance Positions Formally rejected the proposed Southern Nigeria Traditional Rulers Council as exclusionary. Position: \"Justice demands representation, peace requires equality, and development begins with dignity.\" Diaspora Organisation Building chapters across Africa, America, Asia, Europe, and the Middle East. Youth & Women Empowerment Programmes supporting girl-children's education, sanitary health, women's leadership, and youth development. Digital Democracy \"Operational citizenship\" and \"smartphone democracy\" through the Abasians OnLine (AOL) initiative. Recent Recent Actions In February 2026, the Abasi People Foundation issued a formal public statement demanding equal representation for all indigenous southern nationalities in any traditional governance council structure in Nigeria — in solidarity with Igbo traditional rulers who raised similar concerns. APF's position: justice demands representation, peace requires equality, and development begins with dignity. Leadership Founding Executive Leadership Dr. Victor Udo Founding Chairman / President / CEO Ibibio, Obot Akara LGA / USA Diaspora Barrister Orok Okon Deputy Chairman, Legal & Administration Efik Engr. Etim Asuquo Deputy Chairman, Liaison Ibibio Dr. Idara Umoette Secretary General Ibibio Mr. Joe Idiong VP, Treasury & Diaspora Affairs Annang Ms. Favour Uweh Deputy Secretary, Media Oro Mr. Victor Akai Deputy Secretary, Recording & Documentation / Chief Whip Ekid Barrister Egwu Egwu Deputy Secretary, Logistics / Organising & Protocol Ekoi Barrister Sunday Afiko VP, Youth Affairs Obolo Dr. Grace Akpanika VP, Women Affairs Efik Engr. Emmanuel Udo VP, Process Enforcement / Chief of Staff Ibibio Visit the Abasi People Foundation Get Involved Get Involved Connect With the Foundation Listen to the Abasi People Forum Podcast 28 episodes of direct, issue-centric dialogue on governance, unity, emancipation, and equitable development for Ndito Abasi. New episodes weekly. Visit the Podcast Page → Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO, Abasi People Foundation · Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council — Bucknell University (2019–2025) Quick Links Home About Blog & Insights Books Speaking News Gallery Publications Contact Platforms & Organizations VEU AI Studio SAIGE Demo Afri Decarbonization Corp Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast The Podium of Leadership (The POL) with Victor Udo Connect Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com +1 302 898 9542 LinkedIn Bucknell University Former Director of Sustainability & Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025) Lewisburg, Pennsylvania #25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23) ~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved © 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved. ↑ Back to top","contentTruncated":{"html":false,"bodyText":false,"maxStoredHtmlBytes":250000,"maxStoredBodyTextBytes":50000},"contentLength":54799,"findings":[]},{"url":"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people-forum-podcast","depth":1,"status":"fetched","method":"browserless","httpStatus":null,"title":"Abasi People Forum Podcast | Voice of Abasi Nation","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/754a2285a_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n  <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n  <!-- Performance: Preconnect & DNS Prefetch -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" rel=\"preconnect\">\n  <link href=\"https://media.base44.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <link href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\" rel=\"dns-prefetch\">\n  <!-- Google Site Verification -->\n  <meta content=\"UPQLHTlymB5ijLSuhYAcOykBAhG7gB6gbBpg6n10KTA\" name=\"google-site-verification\">\n  <!-- Sitemap Discovery -->\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/sitemap\" rel=\"sitemap\" type=\"application/xml\">\n  <!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\n  <title>Abasi People Forum Podcast | Voice of Abasi Nation</title>\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"title\">\n  \n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, VEU AI Studio, SAIGE, sustainability, ESG, decarbonization, AI, Abasi Nation, Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, Obolo, Ndito Abasi, Abasians, Abasi People Foundation, Afri Decarbonization, carbon neutrality, Nigeria, Akwa Ibom, Bucknell University\" name=\"keywords\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" name=\"author\">\n  <meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\">\n  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\n  <meta content=\"website\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people-forum-podcast\" property=\"og:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" property=\"og:title\">\n  <meta content=\"profile\" property=\"og:type\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio, Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation uniting Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo as Abasi Nation.\" property=\"og:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" property=\"og:image\">\n  <meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\">\n  <meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\">\n  <meta content=\"Dr. Victor Udo\" property=\"og:site_name\">\n  <meta content=\"en_US\" property=\"og:locale\">\n  <!-- Twitter Card -->\n  <meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\">\n  <meta content=\"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people-forum-podcast\" name=\"twitter:url\">\n  <meta content=\"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD | AI Platform Builder · Sustainability Leader · Abasi Foundation Leader · Power Sector Executive\" name=\"twitter:title\">\n  <meta content=\"Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding Chairman/President/CEO of the Abasi People Foundation.\" name=\"twitter:description\">\n  <meta content=\"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_630/79572d658_VEULinkedINPic.jpg\" name=\"twitter:image\">\n  <!-- Structured Data: Person -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Person\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n      \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"jobTitle\": \"AI Platform Builder, Decarbonization Champion\",\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorudo\",\n        \"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Decarbonization\", \"AI Platforms\", \"ESG\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Electric Power Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Public Policy\", \"Abasi Nation\"],\n      \"alumniOf\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Delaware\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"University of Pennsylvania\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"CollegeOrUniversity\", \"name\": \"Howard University\" }\n      ],\n      \"worksFor\": [\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\", \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation\", \"url\": \"https://afridecarbonization.com\" },\n        { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Abasi People Foundation\", \"url\": \"https://abasipeople.org\" }\n      ],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Sustainability\", \"ESG\", \"Decarbonization\", \"Energy Systems\", \"Carbon Markets\", \"Abasi Nation\", \"Public Policy\", \"Corporate Governance\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: Organization (VEU AI Studio) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      \"name\": \"VEU AI Studio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n      \"founder\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\" },\n      \"description\": \"Agentic AI platforms for real-world decision intelligence — SAIGE (ESG/SDGs), RelTwin, ReachSMS, and PressAI.\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\"https://veuaistudio.com\"]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: WebSite with SearchAction (enables Google Sitelinks Search Box) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"description\": \"Official website of Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — AI Builder, Sustainability Leader, and Abasi Foundation Leader.\",\n      \"potentialAction\": {\n        \"@type\": \"SearchAction\",\n        \"target\": {\n          \"@type\": \"EntryPoint\",\n          \"urlTemplate\": \"https://victorudo.com/news?q={search_term_string}\"\n        },\n        \"query-input\": \"required name=search_term_string\"\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: FAQ (common searches about Victor Udo) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who is Dr. Victor Udo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is an AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }, sustainability executive, and community leader with 25+ years of experience in energy, ESG, and decarbonization. He is the Founder of VEU AI Studio (SAIGE, RelTwin, ReachSMS, PressAI), Chairman/CEO of Afri Decarbonization Corporation, and Founding President of the Abasi People Foundation.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is SAIGE by VEU AI Studio?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"SAIGE is an agentic AI platform for enterprise decision intelligence on ESG, SDGs, EHS, CSR, and sustainability governance. It provides real-time analytics and impact assessment for organizations managing sustainability targets and carbon neutrality goals.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Abasi People Foundation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Abasi People Foundation, founded by Dr. Victor Udo, is a movement uniting seven peoples — Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo — as Abasi Nation, the 4th largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria with vision for sustainable development and unity.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is Afri Decarbonization Corporation?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Afri Decarbonization Corporation (ADC), led by Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD as Chairman/CEO, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }, drives nature-based decarbonization and carbon market solutions across West Africa, with 1.6M hectare forest carbon sink MOU and regenerative agriculture initiatives.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What topics does Dr. Victor Udo speak on?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD speaks on AI for enterprise decisions, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }, sustainability leadership, ESG governance, nature-based decarbonization, energy transition, carbon neutrality in higher education, and African development. He has delivered keynotes at Fortune 500 companies, universities, and government forums.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I book Dr. Victor Udo for a speaking engagement?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use the contact form at victorudo.com/contact and select 'Speaking Engagement' as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" } as the inquiry type. Provide event details, audience size, and preferred topics. Dr. Udo personally reviews all speaking requests and responds within 48 hours.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are Dr. Victor Udo's published books?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD is author of 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" } 'Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership & Sustainable Development' (Fulton Books, 2020), 'Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation', and 'Structural and Leadership Insights for National Sustainable Development'. Available on Amazon and major book retailers.\" }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the Bucknell Carbon Neutrality initiative?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University, Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD led the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" } the university toward carbon neutrality by 2030, achieving ~30% carbon reduction and installing a 1.76 MW solar farm. The strategy integrates renewable energy, energy efficiency, and nature-based solutions.\" }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: LocalBusiness (Lewisburg Office) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD\",\n      \"image\": \"https://media.base44.com/images/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/889d7d086_hgj.jpg\",\n      \"description\": \"AI platform builder, sustainability executive, and community leader. Consulting and advisory services for ESG, decarbonization, and enterprise AI decision intelligence.\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Lewisburg\",\n        \"addressRegion\": \"PA\",\n        \"postalCode\": \"17837\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n      },\n      \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n      \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\",\n      \"telephone\": \"+1-570-577-1234\",\n      \"sameAs\": [\n        \"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\",\n        \"https://veuaistudio.com\",\n        \"https://afridecarbonization.com\",\n        \"https://abasipeople.org\"\n      ],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"knowsAbout\": [\n        \"Artificial Intelligence\",\n        \"Enterprise AI\",\n        \"Sustainability\",\n        \"ESG Governance\",\n        \"Decarbonization\",\n        \"Carbon Markets\",\n        \"Energy Transition\",\n        \"Corporate Leadership\",\n        \"Public Policy\",\n        \"African Development\"\n      ]\n    }\n  </script>\n  <!-- Structured Data: ProfessionalService (Consulting & Advisory) -->\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\",\n      \"name\": \"Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD — Sustainability & AI Consulting\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Victor Udo\",\n        \"honorificSuffix\": \"FNSE, PhD\",\n        \"email\": \"info@victorudo.com\",\n        \"url\": \"https://victorudo.com\"\n      },\n      \"serviceType\": [\"Advisory Services\", \"Strategic Consulting\", \"ESG Governance\", \"Sustainability Leadership\", \"Enterprise AI Decision Intelligence\"],\n      \"areaServed\": [\"US\", \"Nigeria\", \"West Africa\"],\n      \"description\": \"Executive advisory and strategic consulting services for organizations pursuing carbon neutrality, ESG excellence, and AI-enabled decision intelligence.\"\n    }\n  </script>\n  <script crossorigin=\"\" src=\"/assets/index-R2wm1Vio.js\" type=\"module\">\n  </script>\n  <link crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/index-DUFtFU2C.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script type=\"module\">\n   if (window.self === window.top) {\n  let lastPath = \"\";\n  function getPageNameFromPath(path) {\n    const segments = path.split(\"/\").filter(Boolean);\n    return segments[0] || null;\n  }\n  function trackPageView() {\n    const path = window.location.pathname;\n    if (path === lastPath) return;\n    lastPath = path;\n    const pageName = getPageNameFromPath(path) || \"home\";\n    const appId = \"69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf\";\n    if (!appId) return;\n    fetch(`/api/app-logs/${appId}/log-user-in-app/${pageName}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n    }).catch(() => {});\n  }\n  const originalPushState = history.pushState.bind(history);\n  history.pushState = function (...args) {\n    originalPushState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  const originalReplaceState = history.replaceState.bind(history);\n  history.replaceState = function (...args) {\n    originalReplaceState(...args);\n    trackPageView();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener(\"popstate\", trackPageView);\n  trackPageView();\n}\n  </script>\n  <meta content=\"yes\" name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\">\n  <meta content=\"black\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\">\n  <meta content=\"VictorUdo.Com\" name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\">\n  <link href=\"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people-forum-podcast\" rel=\"canonical\">\n  <script data-seo-source=\"builder\" type=\"application/ld+json\">\n   {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"abasi people forum podcast\", \"item\": \"https://victorudo.com/abasi-people-forum-podcast\"}]}\n  </script>\n <meta content=\"The Abasi People Forum Podcast (APFP) — the official podcast of the Abasi People Foundation — delivers 28+ episodes of direct, issue-centric dialogue on Abasi Nation emancipation, governance, unity, and equitable development. Representing Ndito Abasi: Ibibio, Annang, Efik, Oro, Ekoi, Ekid, and Obolo peoples — the fourth largest ethnic nationality in Nigeria and across the global Abasian diaspora.\" name=\"description\"></head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"transition-all duration-500 bg-primary\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between h-16 lg:h-20\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"text-white\"><div class=\"font-heading text-lg lg:text-xl font-bold leading-tight\">Dr. Victor Udo</div><div class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] tracking-wide hidden sm:block whitespace-nowrap\">Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader</div></div></a><div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/\">Home</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/about\">About</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/veu-ai-studio\">VEU AI Studio</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People</a><div class=\"absolute left-0 mt-0 w-52 bg-primary border border-white/20 rounded-lg shadow-lg opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-200 z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/abasi-people\">Abasi People Foundation</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/abasi-people-forum-podcast\">Abasi People Forum Podcast</a></div></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/speaking\">Speaking</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap text-white/