sm:text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-white/75 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/mothers-memorial\">Mother's Memorial</a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 py-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-accent-foreground font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 sm:px-6 h-9 sm:h-10 rounded-lg shadow-md\">Work With Victor</button></a><button class=\"lg:hidden text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></div><div class=\"fixed top-16 lg:top-20 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-accent text-accent-foreground flex items-center justify-center py-1.5 px-8\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold hover:underline flex-1 text-center\" href=\"/linkedin-banner\">View Dr. Udo's Profile &amp; Banner Summary →</a><button class=\"absolute right-3 text-accent-foreground/70 hover:text-accent-foreground text-base leading-none\" aria-label=\"Dismiss\">×</button></div><main class=\"flex-1 pt-24 lg:pt-28 transition-all duration-300\"><div><div class=\"relative bg-primary text-white py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-accent/[0.07]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h1 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">Publications</h1><p class=\"text-white/70 text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Peer-reviewed publications spanning engineering, public policy, sustainable development, electric power systems and technology.</p></div></div><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"eyebrow  mb-3 block\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: none;\">Library</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(1.38763px);\">Search Publications</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-8\"><div class=\"relative flex-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search by title...\" class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-background text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring\" value=\"\"></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-primary text-primary-foreground border-primary\">All</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Book</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Journal</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold border transition-colors bg-card text-foreground border-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Dissertation</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">Dissertation</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Exploring Patterns of Sustainable Development, Governance and E-Infrastructure Capacities of Nations for Global Equity Praxis</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">PhD Dissertation — University of Delaware, 2003</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Ranked 132 countries on governance, environmental, social, and technological sustainability across 60+ variables. Principal Advisor: Prof. Robert Warren, School of Urban Affairs and Public Policy.</p><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/71ee5fb87_VEUDissertation.docx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800\">Dissertation</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Adaptive Hierarchical Control for Large-Scale Interconnected Systems</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Master's Thesis (ME) — Howard University</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Thesis exploring adaptive hierarchical control strategies for large-scale interconnected power systems, contributing to foundational research in load-frequency control methodologies.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Which Way Nigeria? Structure, Leadership &amp; Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Fulton Books, 2020</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Navigates post-colonial political and diplomatic conditions, class structure, economic organization, Nigerian culture, ethnic diversity, and the environment. A comprehensive prescription for forward progress through operational citizenship and smartphone democracy. Prescribed reading for Nigerian students, policymakers, and civil servants.</p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Which-Way-Nigeria-Sustainable-Development/dp/1646540387\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation: Looking at Nigeria</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">2021</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Presents the electric power sector as an AC/DC infrastructural value chain using Nigeria as a metaphor. Organized around the Four Concentric Hexagons framework.</p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Sustainability-Insights-Electric-Sector-Transformation-ebook/dp/B096YN3LM8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Book</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development: Looking at Nigeria</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">2021</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Applies the CSDPI/EGSD framework to Nigerian subnational development challenges.</p><a href=\"https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/which-way-nigeria-victor-udo-fnse-phd/1136531763\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Human Progress Towards Equitable Sustainable Development: A Philosophical Exploration</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Problems of Sustainable Development, Vol. 4, No. 2, pp. 23–44, 2009</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Bridging the Gaps for Global Sustainable Development: A Quantitative Analysis</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Journal of Environmental Management, June 2009</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">A Test of Vehicle-to-Grid (V2G) for Energy Storage and Frequency Regulation in the PJM System</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">University of Delaware — Center for Research in Wind (CREW) / Pepco Holdings / PJM Interconnection, 2008</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed\">First real-time demonstration of grid-integrated vehicle providing frequency regulation on the PJM grid. Co-authored with Willett Kempton, Ken Huber, Kevin Komara, Steven Letendre, Scott Baker, Doug Brunner, and Nathaniel Pearre.</p><a href=\"https://crew.udel.edu/v2g/publications/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold mt-3 inline-block hover:underline\">View →</a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Integrating Large Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEEE Conference on Global Sustainable Energy Infrastructure (IEEE Energy 2030), November 2008</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">The Modern Electric Power Industry and Global Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">International Journal of Modern Engineering, Vol. 6, No. 1, Fall 2005</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics, Washington DC, October 2003</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">An Adaptive Control Scheme for Load-Frequency Control of Multi-area Power Systems Parts I &amp; II</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">Electric Power Systems Research Journal, 1992</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-5 border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full mt-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Journal</span><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-foreground leading-snug mb-1\">Self-tuning Load Frequency Control: Multilevel Adaptive Approach</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic\">IEE Proceedings on Generation, Transmission and Distribution, Vol. 141</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"bg-secondary rounded-2xl p-8 mb-10 border border-border/50\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Resource Library</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Research Download Center</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Access papers, books, datasets, and supporting materials from Dr. Udo's research portfolio.</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Papers</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/255621263_A_Test_of_Vehicle-to-Grid_V2G_for_Energy_Storage_and_Frequency_Regulation_in_the_PJM_System\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">V2G Grid Demonstration (2008)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.1 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0301479709001388\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Bridging Gaps for Global Sustainable Development (2009)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">1.8 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/279163999_Recent_results_on_the_integration_of_variable_renewable_electric_power_into_the_US_grid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Integration of Variable Renewable Electric Power</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">1.5 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Books</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Which-Way-Nigeria-Sustainable-Development/dp/1646540387\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Which Way Nigeria? — Structure, Leadership &amp; Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">3.2 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Sustainability-Insights-Electric-Sector-Transformation-ebook/dp/B096YN3LM8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Sustainability Insights for Electric Power Sector Transformation</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.8 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/which-way-nigeria-victor-udo-fnse-phd/1136531763\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Structural and Leadership Insights for Sustainable Development</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">2.6 MB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-border/40\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-5 w-5\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\">Data &amp; Datasets</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/71ee5fb87_VEUDissertation.docx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Dissertation: 132-Nation Sustainability Index &amp; Framework</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">445 KB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://media.base44.com/files/public/69cae26d57b5c4bdd91128cf/9cc991fb1_FindalDpre.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">Dissertation Defense Presentation</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">567 KB</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Victor-Udo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-background hover:bg-secondary/50 border border-border/30 hover:border-border/60 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent transition-colors\">ResearchGate Profile (687+ Citations)</p><p class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\">Profile</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Career Arc</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Interactive Research Roadmap</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Click any milestone to explore detailed research, technical achievements, and associated publications.</p></div><div class=\"relative max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-border\"></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">1992–2003</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Grid Engineering &amp; Load Control</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Published seminal papers on self-tuning load frequency control. Transitioned from Atlantic Electric to Pepco Holdings executive roles.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">IEE/IEEE Publications</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">NJ Renewable Task Force</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">PhD — University of Delaware</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2003–2010</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Research Partnerships &amp; V2G</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Co-authored landmark papers with Prof. Jansson (Rowan) and Prof. Pawłowski (Poland). Led world's first V2G grid demonstration.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">V2G Publication (415+ citations)</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">6 Peer-Reviewed Papers</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">IEEE Energy 2030 Conference</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2010–2020</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Academic Leadership &amp; Sustainability</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Served as Director of Sustainability at Bucknell University. Authored 3 books on Nigeria's governance and energy transformation.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">Bucknell Carbon Neutrality Strategy</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">3 Published Books</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">Susquehanna River Research</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex gap-6 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border-2 border-background group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-border/80 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest\">2020–Present</span></div><h4 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Decarbonization &amp; Platform Building</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\">Founded VEU AI Studio (4 AI platforms) and Afri Decarbonization Corporation. Consultant on NJ State Energy Security Plan.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">VEU AI Studio Launch</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">ADC Foundation</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-foreground border border-border/40\">NJSESP Consultant (BPU)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-accent font-semibold mt-4\">Click to see technical details &amp; papers →</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-2\">Research Ecosystem</p><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Collaborative Partner Profiles</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2\">Explore the leading researchers, institutions, and thought partners who shaped Dr. Udo's academic trajectory.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://i1.rgstatic.net/ii/profile.image/617669665497089-1524275332363_Q64/Peter-Jansso