class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Power systems, renewable energy, photovoltaic integration, grid engineering</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border/40\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary\">6</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Co-authored Papers</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-accent\">2003</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Collaboration Started</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-violet-600\">23+</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Years Active</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Key Publications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>The Role of the Electric Power Industry in Global Sustainable Development (2003)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>Integrating Large-Scale Photovoltaic Power Plants into the U.S. Grid (2008)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-snug\"><span class=\"text-accent flex-shrink-0 font-bold\">•</span><span>The Challenges to Dam Removal on the Susquehanna River (2019)</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-xl border border-border/50 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-border/80 transition-all\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-0\"><div class=\"bg-secondary p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center md:border-r border-border/40\"><img src=\"https://i1.rgstatic.net/ii/profile.image/903031616991235-1592310923822_Q64/Artur-Pawlowski.jpg