16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Washington, DC, USA</div><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Ahmed-Rubaai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-accent text-xs font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline\">ResearchGate <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 p-4 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-lg\"><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground leading-relaxed font-medium italic\">Collaborated during Dr. Udo's graduate research at Howard University on adaptive hierarchical control for large-scale interconnected power systems.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Research Focus</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Power electronics, electric motor drives, adaptive control systems, intelligent control</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border/40\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-primary\">1</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Co-authored Papers</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-accent\">1991</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Collaboration Started</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-violet-600\">35+</div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Years Active</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Key Publications</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-s