nt-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Connect</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a href=\"mailto:Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> Victor.Udo@VEUAIStudio.Com</a></li><li><a href=\"tel:+13028989542\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg> +1 302 898 9542</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victor-udo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/50 hover:text-white text-xs transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> LinkedIn</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold mb-4 text-white/90\">Bucknell University</h4><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Former Director of Sustainability &amp; Chairman, President's Sustainability Council (2019–2025)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">Lewisburg, Pennsylvania</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-2\">#25 Top 50 Green Universities, USA (2022–23)</p><p class=\"text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed\">~30% carbon footprint reduction achieved</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">© 2026 Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD. All rights reserved.</p><button class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors group\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">↑ Back to top</button></div></div></footer></div><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></div></div></div>\n \n\n</body></html>\n","bodyText":"carbon-calculator | VictorUdo.Com Dr. Victor Udo Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Home About VEU AI Studio Abasi People Abasi People Foundation Abasi People Forum Podcast Speaking Publications Contact More ▾ Blog & Insights Carbon Calculator Afri Decarbonization Advisory Services News Gallery Mother's Memorial Work With Victor View Dr. Udo's Profile & Banner Summary → × 404 Page Not Found The page \"carbon-calculator\" could not be found in this application. Go Home Victor Udo, FNSE, PhD Engineer · Executive · AI Builder · Author · Community Leader Founder, VEU AI Studio · Chairman/CEO, Afri Decarbonization Corporation · Founding Chairman/President/CEO